  ' 等 \${alerts.length} 张': ' and \${alerts.length} more',
  '# LiftTrack 用户协议\n\n**版本**: v4.0 | **生效日期**: 2026-09-03\n\n## 一、服务说明\n1. LiftTrack 是由个人开发者黄豪提供的健身训练记录应用\n2. 本应用主要提供：实时训练记录（组数、重量、次数、休息倒计时）、训练计划（内置计划库、自定义计划、扫码导入与分享码导入）、数据统计与身体数据追踪、动作库与图文教学课程、虚拟对手、成就与积分、虚拟物品兑换、训练笔记、健身卡与到期提醒、海报生成与分享、邀请奖励等功能\n3. 使用本应用即表示你已阅读并同意本协议；如不同意，请停止使用本应用\n\n## 二、虚拟商品不退换\n1. 通过积分购买或里程碑解锁的虚拟物品（虚拟对手皮肤、徽章、头像框、称号）及积分解锁的精品训练计划为虚拟商品，一经获取或解锁，不支持退换\n2. 积分通过签到、邀请、训练与笔记等正常使用行为获得，虚拟商品价格与内容以页面展示为准\n3. 法律规定应予退换的除外情形，依照《中华人民共和国消费者权益保护法》执行\n\n## 三、用户行为规范\n1. 不得利用本应用从事任何违法活动\n2. 不得尝试破解、逆向工程本应用，不得篡改、伪造、二次分发邀请码、激活识别码或分享码\n3. 不得恶意刷取积分，不得滥用邀请奖励机制\n4. 如违反上述规定，开发者有权终止向你提供服务，并保留依法追究责任的权利\n\n## 四、个人开发者免责声明\n1. 应用按「现状」提供，不保证完全无错误，但我们会持续改进与更新\n2. 训练建议与教学内容仅供参考，不构成专业医疗建议；如有健康问题请先咨询医生\n3. 你应结合自身身体状况量力而行，因训练造成的人身伤害由本人承担\n4. 因不可抗力、设备或系统故障等原因导致服务中断或数据丢失，开发者不承担由此造成的损失\n5. 本应用数据全部保存在设备本地，卸载应用、清除数据或设备损坏可能导致数据无法恢复，建议你定期导出备份\n\n## 五、账号注销\n1. 本应用无需注册账号，不采集账号信息，故不存在账号注销流程\n2. 你的全部数据均保存在设备本地\n3. 如你希望删除全部数据，可在「设置 → 清除数据」中完成；数据清除后不可恢复，请先导出备份并谨慎操作\n\n## 六、知识产权\n1. 应用代码开源（参见仓库 LICENSE）\n2. 商标「LiftTrack」归开发者所有，未经许可不得使用\n3. 用户生成的训练计划、训练记录、训练笔记归用户所有\n4. 未经授权不得复制、传播本应用的界面设计、动作库、课程内容、海报模板等内置内容\n\n## 七、争议解决\n1. 双方应友好协商解决争议\n2. 协商不成的，提交开发者所在地有管辖权的人民法院处理\n3. 本协议的订立、效力、解释与履行均适用中华人民共和国法律\n4. 开发者联系方式：邮箱 321686496@qq.com，联系电话 15575712021\n': '# LiftTrack User Agreement\n\n**Version**: v4.0 | **Effective Date**: 2026-09-03\n\n## 1. Service Description\n1. LiftTrack is a workout tracking app provided by independent developer Huang Hao\n2. The app mainly provides: real-time workout logging (sets, weight, reps, rest countdown), training plans (built-in plan library, custom plans, QR code import and share code import), data statistics and body data tracking, exercise library and illustrated tutorial courses, virtual opponents, achievements and points, virtual goods redemption, training notes, gym cards and expiry reminders, poster generation and sharing, referral rewards and more\n3. Using this app means you have read and agreed to this agreement; if you do not agree, please stop using the app\n\n## 2. No Returns or Exchanges for Virtual Goods\n1. Virtual goods purchased with points or unlocked through milestones (virtual opponent skins, badges, avatar frames, titles) and premium training plans unlocked with points are virtual goods, and are not eligible for return or exchange once obtained or unlocked\n2. Points are earned through normal use such as check-ins, referrals, training and notes; the price and content of virtual goods are as shown on the page\n3. Exceptions required by law shall be handled in accordance with the Consumer Rights Protection Law of the People\'s Republic of China\n\n## 3. User Conduct\n1. You may not use this app for any illegal activity\n2. You may not attempt to crack or reverse engineer this app, or tamper with, forge or redistribute invite codes, activation identifiers or share codes\n3. You may not maliciously farm points or abuse the referral reward system\n4. If you violate the above, the developer has the right to stop providing the service to you and reserves the right to pursue legal liability\n\n## 4. Independent Developer Disclaimer\n1. The app is provided "as is" and is not guaranteed to be completely error-free, but we will keep improving and updating it\n2. Training advice and course content are for reference only and do not constitute professional medical advice; if you have health concerns, consult a doctor first\n3. You should train within the limits of your own physical condition; any personal injury caused by training is borne by you\n4. The developer is not liable for any loss caused by service interruption or data loss due to force majeure, device or system failure or similar reasons\n5. All app data is stored locally on your device; uninstalling the app, clearing data or device damage may make the data unrecoverable, so please export backups regularly\n\n## 5. Account Deletion\n1. This app requires no account registration and collects no account information, so there is no account deletion process\n2. All of your data is stored locally on your device\n3. If you wish to delete all data, you can do so in "Settings → Clear Data"; data cannot be recovered once cleared, so export a backup first and proceed with care\n\n## 6. Intellectual Property\n1. The app code is open source (see the LICENSE in the repository)\n2. The "LiftTrack" trademark belongs to the developer and may not be used without permission\n3. The training plans, workout records and training notes you create belong to you\n4. You may not copy or distribute the app\'s built-in content such as interface design, exercise library, course content and poster templates without authorization\n\n## 7. Dispute Resolution\n1. Both parties shall settle disputes through friendly negotiation\n2. If negotiation fails, the dispute shall be submitted to the people\'s court with jurisdiction at the developer\'s location\n3. The formation, validity, interpretation and performance of this agreement are governed by the laws of the People\'s Republic of China\n4. Developer contact: email 321686496@qq.com, phone 15575712021\n',
  '# LiftTrack 隐私政策\n\n**版本**: v5.0 | **生效日期**: 2026-09-10\n\n## 一、我们收集的信息\n1. 设备标识符：包括首次启动时在设备本地自动生成的 UUID（device_id），以及在鸿蒙（HarmonyOS）设备上为防刷读取的开放匿名设备标识符（OAID）。OAID 由设备系统生成与管理，属于匿名、非永久性标识，不包含任何可识别你个人身份的信息\n2. 训练数据（训练计划、动作、组数、重量、次数、休息时间、进行中的训练进度）\n3. 身体数据（身高、体重、体脂、围度等由你主动填写的数据及其历史记录）\n4. 训练笔记（你主动记录的文字与图片内容）\n5. 健身卡信息（卡片类型、剩余次数、到期日期，仅用于提供到期与次数提醒）\n6. 应用设置（主题、深色模式、单位、默认组数次数、提醒时间、积分、成就、虚拟物品解锁状态、邀请记录等）\n7. 你主动提供的图片素材（自定义动作封面、自定义头像，仅保存在设备本地）\n\n我们遵循「最小必要」原则：仅收集为你提供健身服务所必需的信息，不收集姓名、手机号、通讯录、精确位置等与核心功能无关的信息。本应用无需注册账号，相关数据均在你主动操作下产生并保存在你的设备上。\n\n## 二、信息使用方式\n1. 提供训练计划制定、实时训练记录、数据统计、身体数据追踪、教学课程、虚拟对手、成就积分与虚拟物品兑换等核心功能\n2. 在你主动操作时，通过本地通知发送训练提醒、休息倒计时提醒、健身卡到期提醒与智能推送提醒（通知内容均由本机生成，不经过任何服务器）\n3. 在你主动操作时生成训练海报、邀请二维码、分享卡片，并调用系统分享功能\n4. 对邀请码、激活识别码、分享码进行本地校验（HMAC-SHA256），以激活邀请奖励或导入分享计划；在鸿蒙（HarmonyOS）设备上，为识别同一设备卸载重装后重复领取邀请奖励的行为，在你明确授权后读取系统提供的开放匿名设备标识符（OAID），并在设备本地完成比对与去重\n5. 在你主动操作时导出全部数据（复制到剪贴板或 JSON），用于备份或迁移到其他设备\n6. 本应用不接入任何第三方广告 SDK，不展示第三方广告，不存在任何形式的广告追踪；所读取的 OAID 仅用于上述邀请防刷用途，不会用于广告定向、个性化推荐或任何跨应用关联\n\n## 三、信息存储位置\n1. 训练数据、身体数据、应用设置与笔记等均存储在你的设备本地（SQLite 数据库 + SharedPreferences + 应用文件目录），不会上传至任何服务器\n2. 本应用完全离线运行，不联网、不传输你的任何训练数据与个人数据\n3. 本地数据受系统沙盒与各平台安全机制保护，其他应用无法直接访问\n4. 因数据仅保存在设备本地，不存在数据出境情形\n\n## 四、第三方 SDK 信息共享\n1. share_plus（系统分享）：仅在你主动点击分享时才调用系统分享面板传递相关内容\n2. mobile_scanner / zxing2（二维码扫描与识别）：全部在设备本机完成，不上传任何图像\n3. image_picker / image_gallery_saver（本地选图与保存海报）：全部在设备本机完成\n4. flutter_local_notifications / permission_handler（本地通知与系统权限）：仅用于在设备本地调度提醒与申请系统权限\n5. url_launcher（跳转链接）：仅用于跳转至应用商店评分页等功能入口\n6. audioplayers（音频播放）：仅用于在设备本地播放休息倒计时提示音，不采集任何音频\n7. 我们不会将你的信息出售、出租或共享给任何第三方用于营销，也不含任何广告 SDK\n\n## 五、未成年人保护\n1. 本应用面向成年健身爱好者，不面向未满 14 周岁的未成年人提供服务\n2. 我们不主动收集未成年人信息\n3. 若监护人发现未成年人误用本应用，可联系下方邮箱申请删除相关数据；本地数据亦可由你本人在应用内「数据与隐私」页面随时清除\n\n## 六、用户权利\n1. 查询：通过「数据与隐私」页面可查看全部本地数据，并可复制导出（粘贴为 JSON）\n2. 更正：可在应用内直接修改身体数据、训练记录、设置与笔记\n3. 删除：通过「清除数据」功能一键清空本地数据（需确认，清除后不可恢复）\n4. 授权管理：通知、相机、相册、跨应用关联（OAID）等系统权限可随时在系统设置中开启或关闭，也可通过系统设置重置 OAID；关闭或重置后仅影响邀请防刷等对应功能，核心训练记录功能不受影响\n5. 无需账号注销：本应用无需注册账号，数据全部保存在设备本地，清除全部数据即视为完成删除\n\n## 七、联系方式\n1. 开发者主体：黄豪\n2. 邮箱：321686496@qq.com\n3. 联系电话：15575712021\n4. 如你对隐私政策有任何疑问或建议，请通过以上方式联系我们，我们会在 15 个工作日内回复。\n\n## 八、政策更新\n1. 我们可能适时更新本隐私政策，更新后会在应用内重新提示你阅读并同意\n2. 重大变更会以弹窗等显著方式通知你，并记录你再次同意的时间与版本\n': '# LiftTrack Privacy Policy\n\n**Version**: v5.0 | **Effective Date**: 2026-09-10\n\n## 1. Information We Collect\n1. Device identifiers: a UUID (device_id) automatically generated locally on your device at first launch, and on HarmonyOS devices the Open Anonymous Device Identifier (OAID) read for anti-abuse purposes. OAID is generated and managed by the device system; it is an anonymous, non-permanent identifier and contains no information that can identify you personally\n2. Training data (training plans, exercises, sets, weight, reps, rest time, in-progress workout state)\n3. Body data (height, weight, body fat, girth measurements and other data you enter yourself, plus their history)\n4. Training notes (the text and images you record yourself)\n5. Gym card information (card type, remaining sessions, expiry date, used only to provide expiry and session reminders)\n6. App settings (theme, dark mode, units, default sets and reps, reminder times, points, achievements, virtual goods unlock status, referral records, etc.)\n7. Images you provide yourself (custom exercise covers, custom avatars, stored only on your device)\n\nWe follow the "minimum necessary" principle: we collect only what is needed to provide you with fitness services, and we do not collect your name, phone number, contacts, precise location or other information unrelated to the core features. This app requires no account registration; the data concerned is generated by your own actions and stored on your device.\n\n## 2. How We Use Information\n1. To provide core features such as training plan creation, real-time workout logging, data statistics, body data tracking, tutorial courses, virtual opponents, achievement points and virtual goods redemption\n2. When you choose to, to send training reminders, rest countdown reminders, gym card expiry reminders and smart push reminders through local notifications (all notification content is generated on your device and never passes through any server)\n3. When you choose to, to generate training posters, referral QR codes and share cards and to call the system share function\n4. To verify invite codes, activation identifiers and share codes locally (HMAC-SHA256) in order to activate referral rewards or import shared plans; on HarmonyOS devices, in order to detect repeat referral reward claims after uninstalling and reinstalling on the same device, we read the system-provided Open Anonymous Device Identifier (OAID) with your explicit authorization and complete the comparison and de-duplication locally on the device\n5. When you choose to, to export all your data (to the clipboard or as JSON) for backup or migration to another device\n6. This app integrates no third-party advertising SDK, displays no third-party ads and performs no form of ad tracking; the OAID read is used only for the referral anti-abuse purpose described above and never for ad targeting, personalized recommendations or any cross-app association\n\n## 3. Where Information Is Stored\n1. Training data, body data, app settings and notes are all stored locally on your device (SQLite database + SharedPreferences + app file directory) and are never uploaded to any server\n2. This app runs completely offline; it does not connect to the network and does not transmit any of your training or personal data\n3. Local data is protected by the system sandbox and each platform\'s security mechanisms; other apps cannot access it directly\n4. Because data is stored only on your device, no data is transferred overseas\n\n## 4. Third-Party SDK Information Sharing\n1. share_plus (system sharing): calls the system share sheet to pass relevant content only when you actively tap share\n2. mobile_scanner / zxing2 (QR code scanning and recognition): performed entirely on your device, with no images uploaded\n3. image_picker / image_gallery_saver (local image selection and poster saving): performed entirely on your device\n4. flutter_local_notifications / permission_handler (local notifications and system permissions): used only to schedule reminders and request system permissions locally on the device\n5. url_launcher (opening links): used only to jump to entry points such as the app store rating page\n6. audioplayers (audio playback): used only to play the rest countdown sound locally on the device; no audio is collected\n7. We will not sell, rent or share your information with any third party for marketing, and the app contains no advertising SDK\n\n## 5. Protection of Minors\n1. This app is intended for adult fitness enthusiasts and is not intended for minors under 14\n2. We do not actively collect information from minors\n3. If a guardian finds that a minor has used this app by mistake, they can contact the email below to request deletion of the relevant data; local data can also be cleared by you at any time on the in-app "Data & Privacy" page\n\n## 6. Your Rights\n1. Access: you can view all local data on the "Data & Privacy" page and copy it out (paste as JSON)\n2. Correction: you can directly modify body data, workout records, settings and notes within the app\n3. Deletion: use the "Clear Data" function to wipe all local data with one tap (confirmation required; it cannot be recovered afterwards)\n4. Permission management: system permissions such as notifications, camera, photo library and cross-app association (OAID) can be turned on or off at any time in system settings, and OAID can also be reset there; turning them off or resetting only affects the corresponding features such as referral anti-abuse, and the core workout logging feature is unaffected\n5. No account deletion needed: this app requires no account registration and all data is stored locally on your device, so clearing all data counts as complete deletion\n\n## 7. Contact\n1. Developer: Huang Hao\n2. Email: 321686496@qq.com\n3. Phone: 15575712021\n4. If you have any questions or suggestions about this privacy policy, please contact us using the methods above and we will reply within 15 business days.\n\n## 8. Policy Updates\n1. We may update this privacy policy from time to time; after an update we will prompt you in the app to read and agree again\n2. Significant changes will be communicated prominently, such as via a popup, and we will record the time and version of your renewed consent\n',
