  '2. 开启「横幅通知」（休息结束提醒会在顶部弹出）\n': '2. Turn on "Banner Notifications" (rest-end reminders pop up at the top)\n',
  '21响训练法：7下半程+7上半程+7全程，TUT延长至40-60秒，负重取10RM的50-60%，限孤立动作': 'The 21s method: 7 bottom-half + 7 top-half + 7 full reps, extending TUT to 40-60 seconds at 50-60% of 10RM, isolation exercises only',
  '2A · 几何哑铃': '2A · Geometric Dumbbell',
  '2B · 圆角方框版': '2B · Rounded Square',
  '2天/周': '2 days/week',
  '2天前': '2 days ago',
  '3 次失败规则': 'Three-Failure Rule',
  '3 步创建你的训练计划': 'Create Your Training Plan in 3 Steps',
  '3. 开启「锁屏通知」（锁屏时也能看到提醒）': '3. Turn on "Lock Screen Notifications" (so you still see reminders when the screen is locked)',
  '30 岁后关节软骨变薄、滑液减少、肩袖肌群退化。杠铃深蹲对腰椎和膝盖的压力、杠铃卧推对肩关节的磨损、传统硬拉对下背的负荷，在长期训练中累积成慢性伤病。健康训练优先选择关节友好的替代动作：器械训练轨迹固定减少稳定肌负担、绳索提供持续张力不冲击关节、哑铃允许自然手腕角度。这不是偷懒，而是延长训练寿命的智慧。': 'After 30, joint cartilage thins, synovial fluid decreases and the rotator cuff degenerates. The stress barbell squats place on the lumbar spine and knees, the wear barbell bench press puts on the shoulder joint, and the load conventional deadlifts place on the lower back all accumulate into chronic injuries over years of training. For healthy training, favor joint-friendly alternatives: machines follow a fixed path that reduces the burden on stabilizer muscles, cables provide constant tension without joint impact, and dumbbells allow a natural wrist angle. This isn\'t slacking — it\'s the wisdom that extends your training career.',
  '30 岁后恢复能力开始下降，表现为：肌肉蛋白合成速率降低、睡眠质量下降、关节软骨修复变慢、激素水平变化（睾酮每年降 1%）。这要求训练者调整策略：①训练频率从每周 4-5 次降至 3-4 次；②大重量训练日间隔 72 小时以上；③增加主动恢复（散步、瑜伽）；④睡眠必须 7 小时以上。强行维持 20 岁的训练量会导致过度训练和伤病。': 'After 30, recovery capacity starts to decline, showing up as: a slower rate of muscle protein synthesis, poorer sleep quality, slower cartilage repair and hormonal changes (testosterone drops about 1% per year). This means trainees have to adjust their strategy: (1) cut training frequency from 4-5 sessions a week to 3-4; (2) leave more than 72 hours between heavy sessions; (3) add active recovery (walking, yoga); (4) get at least 7 hours of sleep. Forcing yourself to keep up a 20-year-old\'s training volume leads to overtraining and injury.',
  '300 积分': '300 points',
  '300 积分 + 布道者徽章': '300 Points + Preacher Badge',
  '300秒': '300 sec',
  '30秒': '30 sec',
  '3A · 实心箭头': '3A · Solid Arrow',
  '3B · 空心箭头': '3B · Hollow Arrow',
  '3天/周': '3 days/week',
  '3天前': '3 days ago',
  '4 周微周期是基础单元，3-4 个微周期组成 12-16 周中周期。每个中周期可聚焦不同目标：第 1 个中周期专注力量保留（强度 80-85%）、第 2 个中周期专注肌肥大（容量 18-22 组/周）、第 3 个中周期专注代谢压力（高次数+超级组）。这种中周期轮换让身体获得多维度刺激，避免单一适应。每个中周期结束评估体成分与力量数据，调整下个中周期重点。': 'A 4-week microcycle is the basic building block, and 3-4 microcycles make up a 12-16 week mesocycle. Each mesocycle can focus on a different goal: the first on strength retention (intensity 80-85%), the second on hypertrophy (volume 18-22 sets/week), the third on metabolic stress (high reps + supersets). Rotating mesocycles this way gives the body multi-dimensional stimulation and avoids a single, stale adaptation. At the end of each mesocycle, assess body composition and strength data and adjust the focus of the next one.',
  '4 周微周期模板': '4-Week Microcycle Template',
  '4 周微周期：积累-积累-积累-减量。\n\n积累周：每肌群 16-20 组/周，强度 75-80% 1RM。\n\n减量周：容量降至 50%，强度降至 70%，主动恢复。': '4-week microcycle: accumulate - accumulate - accumulate - deload.\n\nAccumulation weeks: 16-20 sets per muscle group per week at 75-80% 1RM.\n\nDeload week: volume down to 50%, intensity down to 70%, active recovery.',
  '4 周肌肥大微周期模板': '4-Week Hypertrophy Microcycle Template',
  '4 天上下肢分化模板': '4-Day Upper/Lower Split Template',
  '4 章带你认识健身房最常见器械：自由重量区与固定器械各练哪些部位，如何根据目标选器械，以及安全使用要点。新手进健身房不再无所适从，看图就能找到"练这里的这台器械"。': '4 chapters introducing the most common gym equipment: which muscles free weights and machines each train, how to choose equipment for your goal, and key safety points. Beginners won\'t feel lost walking into the gym — just look at the picture and find "the machine that trains this part".',
  '4 章掌握中老年科学健身方法：运动前的健康评估、温和力量训练、平衡训练预防跌倒与日常活动建议。低冲击、安全可控，帮你保持活力、预防跌倒、延缓肌肉流失。': '4 chapters on a scientific approach to fitness for older adults: pre-exercise health screening, gentle strength training, balance training to prevent falls, and everyday activity advice. Low impact, safe and controllable — helping you stay active, prevent falls and slow muscle loss.',
  '4 章掌握居家零器械训练的系统方法：训练角搭建、自身体重动作库、新手时间安排与习惯养成、进阶升级路径。专为零基础、居家健身的你设计，安全易上手，让健身真正融入日常生活。': '4 chapters on a systematic approach to equipment-free home training: setting up your training corner, a bodyweight exercise library, scheduling and habit building for beginners, and a progression path. Designed for complete beginners training at home — safe, easy to start, and built to make fitness part of everyday life.',
  '4-6组保持最大速度': '4-6 sets at maximum speed',
  '4A · LT 嵌套': '4A · Nested LT',
  '4B · 圆形徽章': '4B · Circular Badge',
  '4天/周': '4 days/week',
  '5 章掌握 HIIT 减脂的科学方法：原理与 EPOC、动作设计、间歇协议、与力量训练的平衡、安全与进阶。适合有一定训练基础、追求高效减脂的训练者。': '5 chapters on the science of HIIT for fat loss: the principles and EPOC, exercise design, interval protocols, balancing it with strength training, and safety and progression. For trainees with a solid base who want efficient fat loss.',
  '5/3/1 BBB辅助量过大（5×10取60% 1RM）与主项冲突，应取50-60% 1RM并保留2-3 RIR': '5/3/1 BBB: the assistance volume is too high (5×10 at 60% 1RM) and conflicts with the main lift; use 50-60% 1RM and keep 2-3 RIR',
  '50 积分': '50 Points',
