  '600 积分': '600 points',
  '600 积分 + 传道者徽章 + 限定对手皮肤': '600 Points + Evangelist Badge + Limited Opponent Skin',
  '60秒': '60 sec',
  '6A · L 横杠=哑铃杆': '6A · L Bar = Dumbbell Handle',
  '6B · 圆角方框版': '6B · Rounded Square',
  '6天/周': '6 days/week',
  '85-95%最大心率': '85-95% max heart rate',
  '8个卧推变式：平板/上斜/下斜/窄距/宽距/暂停/地板/链式': '8 Bench Press Variations: Flat/Incline/Decline/Close-Grip/Wide-Grip/Pause/Floor/Chains',
  '90% 的塑形瓶颈可归因于四类：训练单调（连续 6 周以上使用相同动作/重量/组数）、容量不足（单肌群每周 < 10 组）、营养不到位（蛋白质 < 1.6g/kg 或热量缺口过大）、恢复不足（睡眠 < 7 小时或训练频率过高）。诊断顺序建议从恢复→营养→容量→动作依次排查，先解决最基础的不足再做训练层面的调整。': '90% of physique plateaus come down to four causes: monotonous training (the same exercises, weights and sets for 6+ weeks straight), insufficient volume (fewer than 10 sets per muscle group per week), poor nutrition (protein under 1.6g/kg or too large a calorie deficit) and inadequate recovery (less than 7 hours of sleep or training too often). Diagnose in the order recovery → nutrition → volume → exercise selection, fixing the most basic gaps before tweaking your training.',
