  'RIR量表锚定RPE：RPE 10=力竭、RPE 9=还能1次、RPE 8=还能2次，预测偏差约±1次倾向低估': 'Anchoring RPE to the RIR scale: RPE 10 = failure, RPE 9 = 1 rep left, RPE 8 = 2 reps left; predictions are off by about ±1 rep and tend to underestimate',
  'RPE Stop自调节法：首组目标RPE后继续同重量做组，某组RPE比首组高2分即停止': 'RPE Stop autoregulation: once you hit the target RPE on your first set, keep working with the same weight; stop when a set\'s RPE is 2 points higher than the first set',
  'RPE控制：主项保留RPE 7-9（2-3 RIR），孤立动作可至RPE 9-10，复合动作避免绝对力竭降低神经疲劳': 'RPE control: keep main lifts at RPE 7-9 (2-3 RIR), isolation exercises can go to RPE 9-10, and avoid absolute failure on compound lifts to limit neural fatigue',
  'RPE自调节：减脂期能量不足神经驱动下降，维持RPE 7-9范围，避免盲目追求PR': 'RPE autoregulation: during a cut, low energy blunts neural drive, so stay within RPE 7-9 and don\'t blindly chase PRs',
  'Service 已初始化': 'Service initialized',
  'SystemPlanLibrary: 加载 \$goal.json 失败: \$e': 'SystemPlanLibrary: failed to load \$goal.json: \$e',
  'SystemPlanLibrary: 已加载 \${_plans.length} 个系统计划': 'SystemPlanLibrary: loaded \${_plans.length} system plans',
  'TDEE（每日总能量消耗）= BMR（基础代谢）× 活动系数。用 Mifflin-St Jeor 公式估算 BMR：男性为 10×体重+6.25×身高-5×年龄+5，女性为 10×体重+6.25×身高-5×年龄-161。再根据训练频率选择活动系数（久坐 1.2、轻度 1.375、中度 1.55、高强度 1.725）。目标摄入 = TDEE - 缺口值。建议每减 3-5kg 体重重新计算一次，因为代谢会随体重下降而降低。': 'TDEE (total daily energy expenditure) = BMR (basal metabolic rate) × activity factor. Estimate BMR with the Mifflin-St Jeor formula: for men, 10 × weight + 6.25 × height - 5 × age + 5; for women, 10 × weight + 6.25 × height - 5 × age - 161. Then pick an activity factor based on training frequency (sedentary 1.2, light 1.375, moderate 1.55, high 1.725). Target intake = TDEE - deficit. Recalculate every time you lose 3-5 kg, because metabolism drops along with body weight.',
  'TUT 与肌肥大': 'TUT and Hypertrophy',
  'Tabata 协议详解': 'The Tabata Protocol in Detail',
  'Tabata 是最经典的 HIIT 协议：20 秒高强度（达 95% 最大心率）+ 10 秒休息，循环 8 次，总时长 4 分钟。由日本研究员 Izumi Tabata 设计，研究显示每周 4 次 Tabata + 1 次稳态有氧，6 周后无氧能力提升 28%、VO2max 提升 14%。Tabata 适合时间紧张但追求高效者。但强度极高，不适合初学者。建议先从 30/30 协议开始，4-8 周后再尝试 Tabata。Tabata 通常选 1-2 个动作循环，避免频繁切换影响强度。': 'Tabata is the most classic HIIT protocol: 20 seconds of high intensity (reaching 95% of max heart rate) plus 10 seconds of rest, repeated for 8 rounds, 4 minutes in total. Designed by Japanese researcher Izumi Tabata, whose study showed that 4 Tabata sessions plus 1 steady-state session per week raised anaerobic capacity by 28% and VO2max by 14% over 6 weeks. Tabata suits people short on time who want maximum efficiency, but the intensity is extreme and it is not for beginners. Start with a 30/30 protocol and try Tabata after 4-8 weeks. Tabata usually cycles through 1-2 exercises, since switching frequently blunts intensity.',
  'Tabata：20/10 × 8 = 4 分钟，强度极高，适合进阶\n30/30：30 秒高强度 + 30 秒休息，8-10 轮，适合中级\n40/20：40 秒高强度 + 20 秒休息，6-8 轮，强度适中\n金字塔：10/20/30/40/30/20/10 秒递增递减，趣味性强\nEMOM：每分钟完成规定次数，剩余时间休息，灵活': 'Tabata: 20/10 × 8 = 4 minutes, extremely high intensity, for advanced\n30/30: 30 sec work + 30 sec rest, 8-10 rounds, for intermediate\n40/20: 40 sec work + 20 sec rest, 6-8 rounds, moderate intensity\nPyramid: 10/20/30/40/30/20/10 seconds ramping up then down, fun and varied\nEMOM: complete a set number of reps each minute, rest the remainder, flexible',
  'Tabata：20s 高强度 + 10s 休息 × 8 = 4 分钟。\n\n30/30：30s 高强度 + 30s 休息，8-10 轮。\n\n金字塔：10/20/30/40/30/20/10 秒递增递减。': 'Tabata: 20s work + 10s rest × 8 = 4 minutes.\n\n30/30: 30s work + 30s rest, 8-10 rounds.\n\nPyramid: 10/20/30/40/30/20/10 seconds, ramping up then down.',
  'Top 5 训练次数': 'Top 5 by Workout Count',
  'WHO 建议：每周 150 分钟中等强度或 75 分钟高强度有氧。\n\n最佳形式：快走/骑行/游泳/椭圆机，低冲击保护关节。\n\n强度控制：心率维持 60-75% 最大心率（220-年龄）。': 'WHO recommendation: 150 minutes of moderate-intensity or 75 minutes of high-intensity cardio per week.\n\nBest options: brisk walking/cycling/swimming/elliptical — low impact and easy on the joints.\n\nIntensity: keep heart rate at 60-75% of max (220 - age).',
  'WHO 有氧建议': 'WHO Cardio Guidelines',
  '[DailyReminder] 已写入 App 内通知记录': '[DailyReminder] In-app notification record written',
