  '一个 HIIT 训练包含 4-6 个动作，按"全身-下肢-上肢-核心-全身"顺序设计，避免单一肌群连续力竭。例如：开合跳（全身热身）→ 高抬腿（下肢）→ 俯卧撑（上肢）→ 登山者（核心）→ 波比跳（全身冲刺）。每个动作 30 秒、休息 15 秒、循环 4-5 轮。动作间切换不超过 5 秒，维持心率。每个循环间休息 60-90 秒。这样的设计兼顾全身刺激和心率维持。': 'A HIIT session contains 4-6 exercises ordered "full body - lower body - upper body - core - full body" so you never take the same muscle group to failure twice in a row. For example: jumping jacks (full-body warm-up) → high knees (lower body) → push-ups (upper body) → mountain climbers (core) → burpees (full-body finisher). 30 seconds per exercise, 15 seconds rest, 4-5 rounds. Keep transitions under 5 seconds to hold heart rate, and rest 60-90 seconds between rounds. This design delivers full-body stimulation while keeping heart rate up.',
