  '上下肢分化关键：每次训练控制 60-75 分钟内完成，避免容量膨胀。复合动作占训练 70%，孤立动作补足弱区': 'Key points of an upper/lower split: finish every session within 60-75 minutes to avoid volume creep. Compound lifts make up 70% of the workout, isolation work covers weak points',
  '上下肢分化每周 4 次：周一上肢、周二下肢、周四上肢、周五下肢。\n\n每肌群每周 2 次刺激，符合 48-72 小时合成窗口。\n\n塑形期容量建议：每肌群每周 12-16 组，复合 70%、孤立 30%。': 'Upper/lower split 4 times a week: Monday upper, Tuesday lower, Thursday upper, Friday lower.\n\nEach muscle group is trained twice a week, matching the 48-72 hour synthesis window.\n\nVolume for a shaping phase: 12-16 sets per muscle group per week, 70% compound and 30% isolation.',
