  '下肢是力量的根基。本章介绍练腿、练臀、练核心的固定器械，以及它们各自的肌群与动作要点。': 'The lower body is the foundation of strength. This chapter covers the machines for legs, glutes and core, along with the muscle groups and technique cues for each.',
