  '下腹部：仰卧举腿/悬垂举腿/反向卷腹，每组12-20次，重点感受下腹收缩避免利用惯性': 'Lower abs: lying leg raises / hanging leg raises / reverse crunches, 12-20 reps per set; focus on contracting the lower abs and avoid using momentum',
