  '为零基础与初级训练者打造的力量入门课程，从动作模式、呼吸核心到线性进阶，4 章掌握深蹲/卧推/硬拉三大项的安全训练与持续进步方法。': 'A strength foundation course built for complete beginners and early intermediates — from movement patterns and breathing and bracing to linear progression, 4 chapters that teach you how to train the squat, bench press and deadlift safely and keep progressing.',
