  '主项5×6-8次取RPE 8（2 RIR），辅助3×10-15次取RPE 9（1 RIR），复合动作组间3分钟、孤立2分钟': 'Main lifts 5×6-8 at RPE 8 (2 RIR), accessories 3×10-15 at RPE 9 (1 RIR), 3 minutes rest between compound sets and 2 minutes for isolation',
  '主项力量训练：取RPE 7-9（保留1-3次）累积高质量组数；肌肥大辅助可至RPE 9-10': 'Main strength work: RPE 7-9 (1-3 reps in reserve) to accumulate high-quality sets; hypertrophy accessories can go to RPE 9-10',
  '主项动作（卧推/引体/深蹲）取5×5末组AMRAP，辅助动作3×8-12次，组间休息复合3-5分钟、孤立1.5-2分钟': 'Main lifts (bench / pull-up / squat) 5×5 with the last set as AMRAP, accessories 3×8-12, resting 3-5 minutes on compounds and 1.5-2 minutes on isolation',
