  '举起最大重量': 'Lift the max weight',
  '举重大师': 'Weightlifting Master',
  '习惯养成的关键在于固定时间和环境线索。选择一个每天都能空出的时间段（如早晨起床后、下班后、睡前），准备好训练垫，把训练当作用餐一样固定下来。刚开始不用追求强度，先保证"每周都练"这一件事。连续坚持 4-6 周后，你会发现自己开始期待训练。': 'Habit building comes down to fixed times and environmental cues. Pick a daily slot you can always free up (right after waking up, after work, before bed), lay out your mat, and make training as fixed a part of your day as meals. Don\'t chase intensity at the start — just make sure you train every week. After 4-6 consistent weeks, you\'ll find yourself looking forward to it.',
