  '休息中': 'Resting',
  '休息倒计时结束后会振动并弹出通知提醒': 'When the rest countdown ends, your phone will vibrate and a notification will pop up',
  '休息提醒': 'Rest Reminder',
  '休息提醒未收到？': 'Not receiving rest reminders?',
  '休息日': 'Rest Day',
  '休息日 · 充分恢复': 'Rest Day · Full Recovery',
  '休息日 — 充分恢复，准备下一次训练': 'Rest Day — Recover fully and get ready for your next workout',
  '休息日不是躺平。做 20-30 分钟轻度有氧（快走、骑车、游泳）或全身拉伸、瑜伽，能促进血液循环、加速代谢废物清除、缓解延迟性肌肉酸痛。完全不动的休息日反而让你感觉更僵硬、第二天训练状态更差。但要注意控制强度——主动恢复的目的是促进循环，不是再加一次训练。': 'A rest day isn\'t about lying around. Doing 20-30 minutes of light cardio (brisk walking, cycling, swimming) or full-body stretching and yoga improves blood flow, speeds up the clearance of metabolic waste and eases delayed onset muscle soreness. A rest day with zero movement actually leaves you feeling stiffer and worse in your next session. But keep the intensity in check — the point of active recovery is to boost circulation, not to add another workout.',
  '休息日名称': 'Rest Day Name',
  '休息时间已超，按需结束休息开始下一组。': 'Rest time is up; end the rest whenever you\'re ready and start your next set.',
