  '保持均匀呼吸': 'Keep Breathing Steadily',
  '保持均匀呼吸（三步一吸两步一呼）和稳定步伐，前脚掌或全脚掌着地，摆臂自然放松，核心收紧。': 'Keep your breathing even (inhale for three steps, exhale for two) and your stride steady, land on the forefoot or the whole foot, swing your arms naturally and keep your core braced.',
