  '先慢跑5-10分钟热身，动态拉伸下肢，激活臀部和核心，预防拉伤，逐步提升心率准备冲刺。': 'Jog for 5-10 minutes first to warm up, dynamically stretch the lower body, activate the glutes and core to prevent strains, and gradually raise your heart rate to prepare for sprints.',
