  '先进行5分钟快走或动态拉伸热身，活动脚踝、膝关节和髋关节，逐步提升心率至目标区间。': 'Start with 5 minutes of brisk walking or dynamic stretching to warm up, mobilizing the ankles, knees and hips and gradually raising your heart rate into the target zone.',
