  '关节友好不等于无效。研究显示器械训练在肌肥大效果上与自由重量无显著差异，关键是负荷与渐进': 'Joint-friendly doesn\'t mean ineffective. Research shows machines produce no significant difference in hypertrophy compared with free weights — what matters is load and progression',
  '关节友好动作清单': 'Joint-friendly exercise list',
  '关节友好动作：器械训练/绳索/哑铃优于杠铃。\n\n推荐动作：腿举/高位下拉/坐姿推胸/绳索划船。\n\n负荷：60-75% 1RM，2-3 组×10-12 次，避免力竭。': 'Joint-friendly exercises: machines / cables / dumbbells over barbells.\n\nRecommended moves: leg press / lat pulldown / seated chest press / cable row.\n\nLoad: 60-75% 1RM, 2-3 sets × 10-12 reps, avoid failure.',
