  '农夫行走': 'Farmer\'s Carry',
  '冲刺后转入慢跑或快走1-2分钟恢复，心率降至60-70%，保持轻微活动不静止站立。': 'After the sprint, switch to a jog or brisk walk for 1-2 minutes to recover, bringing your heart rate down to 60-70% and staying lightly active instead of standing still.',
  '冲刺跑': 'Sprint',
  '冲刺跑发展爆发力和速度，全面刺激快肌纤维，提升无氧能力。': 'Sprinting develops power and speed, recruiting fast-twitch fibers across the board and improving anaerobic capacity.',
  '准备姿势': 'Setup',
  '凌云': 'Soaring',
  '减脂': 'Fat Loss',
  '减脂不是一场战役，而是一种生活方式的转变。': 'Fat loss isn\'t a battle — it\'s a lifestyle shift.',
  '减脂期力量训练容量保留至赤字前 60-80%，强度（%1RM）保留至 90% 以上。优先削减辅助动作容量，主项容量尽量保留。例如原方案深蹲 5×5+腿举 3×8+腿弯举 3×12，减脂期可保留深蹲 5×5、腿举降至 2×8、腿弯举降至 2×12。HIIT 每周 2-3 次，每次 15-25 分钟。这样的容量配比在热量缺口中最大化保留肌肉量，同时通过 HIIT 增加热量消耗和 EPOC。': 'During a cut, keep strength training volume at 60-80% of pre-deficit levels and intensity (%1RM) above 90%. Cut accessory volume first and preserve main lift volume as much as possible. For example, if your original program is squat 5×5 + leg press 3×8 + leg curl 3×12, during a cut you can keep squat 5×5, drop leg press to 2×8 and leg curl to 2×12. Do HIIT 2-3 times a week, 15-25 minutes a session. This volume split maximizes muscle retention in a deficit while HIIT adds calorie burn and EPOC.',
  '减脂期力量训练是"主"，HIIT 是"辅"。如果时间紧张，优先保证力量训练，HIIT 可减至每周 1 次': 'During a cut, strength training is the "main course" and HIIT is the "side". If time is tight, prioritize strength training and cut HIIT to once a week',
  '减脂期的容量管理': 'Volume management during a cut',
  '减脂期的食材管理同样关键。建议每周固定一天集中采购，按 meal prep（备餐）思路批量烹饪 3-4 天的份量，分装冷藏。这样能避免临时决策导致的外卖和暴食，也让你对每天摄入的热量和宏量营养素更有掌控。备餐的核心是蛋白质 + 复杂碳水 + 蔬菜的固定组合，再通过调料和烹饪方式变化保持新鲜感，让减脂期饮食既科学又不乏味。': 'Food management is just as important during a cut. Pick one fixed day a week to shop in bulk and batch-cook 3-4 days of meals meal-prep style, then portion and refrigerate them. This avoids takeout and bingeing from last-minute decisions, and gives you control over your daily calories and macros. The core of meal prep is a fixed combination of protein + complex carbs + vegetables, with variety coming from seasonings and cooking methods, so cutting food stays both scientific and enjoyable.',
  '减脂期硬核控制饮食的会计师': 'The accountant who controls diet hard during a cut',
  '减脂期脂肪摄入不是越低越好。脂肪占总热量的 25-30%，不低于每公斤体重 0.8 克。脂肪过低会导致睾酮下降、皮肤干燥、关节不适、激素紊乱，反而阻碍减脂进程。优选不饱和脂肪：牛油果、坚果（杏仁/核桃）、橄榄油、鱼油。坚决避免反式脂肪（人造奶油、植脂末、部分氢化油），它不仅促进脂肪堆积还危害心血管健康。': 'Fat intake during a cut shouldn\'t be as low as possible. Fat should be 25-30% of total calories and no less than 0.8 g per kg of body weight. Too little fat lowers testosterone, dries out your skin, causes joint discomfort and hormonal disruption, which actually slows fat loss. Prefer unsaturated fats: avocado, nuts (almonds / walnuts), olive oil, fish oil. Strictly avoid trans fats (margarine, non-dairy creamer, partially hydrogenated oils), which not only promote fat storage but also harm cardiovascular health.',
  '减脂期脂肪降到总热量 20% 以下是常见错误，会损害激素水平。脂肪是睾酮的前体，睾酮低则肌肉流失、代谢下降': 'Cutting fat to below 20% of total calories during a cut is a common mistake that damages hormone levels. Fat is the precursor of testosterone, and low testosterone means muscle loss and a slower metabolism',
  '减脂期蛋白质比增肌期更重要。每公斤体重 1.8-2.4 克是合理范围，高蛋白饮食能保肌肉、增饱腹、提升食物热效应——消化蛋白质消耗的热量是碳水的 3 倍。优质来源包括鸡胸肉、鱼虾、鸡蛋清、希腊酸奶、低脂牛奶、瘦牛肉、乳清蛋白粉。每餐保证 25-40 克蛋白质摄入，能在减脂期最大化保留肌肉量，让你减下去的是脂肪而不是肌肉。': 'Protein matters more during a cut than during a bulk. 1.8-2.4 g per kg of body weight is a sensible range; a high-protein diet preserves muscle, increases satiety and raises the thermic effect of food — digesting protein burns 3 times the calories of carbs. Quality sources include chicken breast, fish and shrimp, egg whites, Greek yogurt, low-fat milk, lean beef and whey protein powder. Getting 25-40 g of protein per meal maximizes muscle retention during a cut, so what you lose is fat, not muscle.',
  '减脂期重量过轻（<60% 1RM）无法给肌肉足够保留信号，应维持训练强度': 'Weights that are too light during a cut (<60% 1RM) don\'t give muscles a strong enough signal to stay; maintain training intensity',
  '减脂核心原理：热量消耗 > 热量摄入。\n\n合理缺口：每日300-500大卡缺口，每周减0.5-1磅脂肪。\n\n过大缺口的风险：肌肉流失、代谢下降、内分泌紊乱。\n\n计算TDEE：用公式或App估算每日总消耗，再减去缺口值得到目标摄入。\n\n记录饮食：前2周记录所有入口食物，建立热量直觉。': 'Core principle of fat loss: calories out > calories in.\n\nSensible deficit: a daily 300-500 calorie deficit, losing 0.5-1 lb of fat per week.\n\nRisks of too large a deficit: muscle loss, slower metabolism, hormonal disruption.\n\nCalculate TDEE: estimate your total daily expenditure with a formula or app, then subtract the deficit to get your target intake.\n\nTrack your food: log everything you eat for the first 2 weeks to build calorie intuition.',
  '减脂核心原理：热量缺口（饮食占70%）+ 力量训练（保留肌肉，容量保留至赤字前60-80%）+ 有氧（增加消耗）': 'Core principle of fat loss: calorie deficit (diet accounts for 70%) + strength training (preserve muscle, keep volume at 60-80% of pre-deficit) + cardio (increase expenditure)',
  '减脂的唯一真理：热量缺口': 'The one truth of fat loss: a calorie deficit',
  '减脂结束后不要立即恢复原饮食，用 2-4 周反向饮食——每周增加 100 大卡直至维持热量。这能让代谢缓慢适应，避免脂肪快速反弹。反向饮食期间体重可能微增，但大部分是水分和糖原，不是脂肪。这是减脂成功的最后一公里，跳过它等于把前面 12 周的成果拱手送回。': 'Don\'t jump straight back to your old diet when a cut ends — spend 2-4 weeks reverse dieting, adding 100 calories a week until you reach maintenance. This lets your metabolism adapt gradually and prevents rapid fat rebound. You may gain a little weight during a reverse diet, but most of it is water and glycogen, not fat. This is the last mile of a successful cut; skipping it hands back everything you earned over the previous 12 weeks.',
  '减脂饮食全攻略': 'The Complete Guide to a Cutting Diet',
  '减量周不是偷懒，而是让神经系统和结缔组织充分恢复。跳过减量周连续累加，3-4 周后必然出现力量退步和过度训练信号': 'A deload week isn\'t slacking — it lets your nervous system and connective tissue fully recover. Skipping deloads and stacking load week after week will bring strength regression and overtraining signals within 3-4 weeks',
  '减量周容量降至 50%、强度降至 70% 是关键。完全休息会让积累周的适应信号衰减，轻度训练保持刺激同时恢复': 'Dropping volume to 50% and intensity to 70% during a deload week is the key. Complete rest lets the adaptation signal from your accumulation weeks fade, while light training maintains the stimulus as you recover',
  '凳面角度30-45度': 'Bench angle 30-45 degrees',
  '出差中，本周只能练1次': 'On a business trip, can only train once this week',
  '出现 2 个以上信号立即 deload。等待 4 个以上信号才停训，往往已进入过度训练综合征，需要 4-8 周恢复': 'Deload immediately when 2 or more signals show up. Waiting until 4 or more signals before stopping usually means you\'ve already entered overtraining syndrome, which takes 4-8 weeks to recover from',
  '出示激活凭证': 'Show activation proof',
