  '分日进行：力量日 + HIIT 日 + 休息日 轮换\n同日分时：力量早 + HIIT 晚，间隔 6 小时以上\n顺序原则：同日先力量后 HIIT，避免力量表现受损\n间隔最小：力量与 HIIT 间隔 ≥ 6 小时\n力量前 24 小时不做 HIIT，避免影响主项力量': 'Split by day: strength day + HIIT day + rest day, rotating\nSame day, different times: strength in the morning + HIIT at night, at least 6 hours apart\nOrder principle: strength first, then HIIT on the same day, to avoid hurting strength performance\nMinimum gap: at least 6 hours between strength and HIIT\nNo HIIT in the 24 hours before strength work, to protect main lift performance',
