  '刺激股四头肌更充分': 'Stimulates the quadriceps more effectively',
  '前 2 周记录所有入口食物，包括小零食和调料\n使用薄荷健康/MyFitnessPal 等 App 扫码录入\n厨房秤估算食物重量，避免差不多的误差\n特别注意调料、酱汁、饮品的热量，往往被低估\n建立热量直觉后可放松记录，但建议每月回顾一周': 'For the first 2 weeks, log everything you eat, including small snacks and condiments\nUse an app like Bohe Health/MyFitnessPal to scan and log items\nUse a kitchen scale to estimate food weight and avoid rough guesses\nPay special attention to condiments, sauces, and drinks — their calories are often underestimated\nOnce you have calorie intuition you can relax the logging, but review one week every month',
