  '力拔山兮': 'Herculean Strength',
  '力量': 'Strength',
  '力量 = 神经募集 + 肌肉横截面 + 技术效率。\n\n力量训练 vs 肌肥大训练：重量更重（≥85% 1RM）、次数更少（1-5）、组间更长（3-5分钟）。\n\n三大项优先：深蹲/卧推/硬拉覆盖全身大肌群。': 'Strength = neural recruitment + muscle cross-sectional area + technical efficiency.\n\nStrength training vs. hypertrophy training: heavier loads (≥85% 1RM), fewer reps (1-5), longer rest between sets (3-5 minutes).\n\nThe Big Three first: squat/bench press/deadlift cover all the major muscle groups.',
  '力量不是单一因素，而是神经募集能力、肌肉横截面积、技术效率的乘积。神经募集决定你能调动多少运动单位同时发力；肌肉横截面决定单个运动单位能产生多大力量；技术效率决定力量能否高效传递到杠铃。初学者前 8 周的力量增长主要来自神经适应（70%），肌肉增长只占 30%，这就是为什么"练力量但不长围度"在前 2 个月是正常现象。': 'Strength isn\'t a single factor — it\'s the product of neural recruitment, muscle cross-sectional area, and technical efficiency. Neural recruitment determines how many motor units you can fire at once; cross-sectional area determines how much force a single motor unit can produce; technical efficiency determines whether that force transfers efficiently to the bar. In the first 8 weeks, about 70% of a beginner\'s strength gains come from neural adaptation and only 30% from muscle growth, which is why getting stronger without getting bigger is completely normal for the first 2 months.',
  '力量与 HIIT 的时间安排': 'Scheduling Strength Training and HIIT',
  '力量保留：每周 2 次全身训练，保留肌肉量与代谢\n心肺功能：每周 3 次中等强度有氧，150 分钟/周\n关节灵活：每日 10 分钟动态拉伸+泡沫轴\n生活方式：7-8 小时睡眠、蛋白质 1.2-1.6g/kg、压力管理': 'Strength maintenance: 2 full-body sessions per week to preserve muscle mass and metabolism\nCardio: 3 moderate-intensity cardio sessions per week, 150 minutes/week\nJoint mobility: 10 minutes of dynamic stretching + foam rolling daily\nLifestyle: 7-8 hours of sleep, protein 1.2-1.6g/kg, stress management',
  '力量的三要素': 'The Three Elements of Strength',
  '力量的增长本质是对抗阻力的适应。每次训练给身体一个超出当前的刺激（更重/更多），身体在恢复期超量恢复，下次能承受更大刺激。这就是渐进超负荷。初学者可线性进阶——每次训练主项加 2.5kg（上肢）或 5kg（下肢），持续 8-12 周。这种简单的线性进阶是新手力量增长最快的方法，不要复杂化。': 'The essence of strength gain is adaptation to resistance. Every session gives the body a stimulus beyond its current capacity (heavier/more), and during recovery the body supercompensates so it can handle a bigger stimulus next time. This is progressive overload. Beginners can progress linearly — add 2.5kg (upper body) or 5kg (lower body) to the main lift each session for 8-12 weeks. This simple linear progression is the fastest way for a novice to build strength — don\'t overcomplicate it.',
  '力量的渐进本质': 'The Progressive Nature of Strength',
  '力量翻': 'Power Clean',
  '力量训练 vs 肌肥大训练': 'Strength Training vs. Hypertrophy Training',
  '力量训练优先：保留赤字前训练强度（%1RM）+ 60-80%训练量，优先削减辅助量而非主项': 'Strength training first: keep pre-deficit training intensity (%1RM) + 60-80% of volume, cut assistance volume before main lifts',
  '力量训练基础': 'Strength Training Basics',
  '力量训练是对抗肌肉流失、骨质疏松的关键。本章介绍安全温和的力量动作，从自身体重和弹力带开始，循序渐进。': 'Strength training is key to fighting muscle loss and osteoporosis. This chapter covers safe, gentle strength exercises, starting with bodyweight and resistance bands and progressing step by step.',
  '力量训练组间休息必须 3 分钟以上。ATP-CP 系统恢复需要 3-5 分钟，休息不足会切换到糖酵解供能，影响大重量表现': 'Rest between strength sets must be at least 3 minutes. The ATP-CP system needs 3-5 minutes to recover; insufficient rest shifts you to glycolytic energy supply and hurts heavy-lift performance',
  '加速至最大速度，保持正确跑姿，摆臂幅度大，步频快，前脚掌着地，目视前方不低头。': 'Accelerate to maximum speed, maintain proper running form, swing the arms through a large range, keep a fast cadence, land on the forefoot, and look straight ahead without dropping the head.',
  '动作 1：哑铃卧推（胸）': 'Exercise 1: Dumbbell Bench Press (Chest)',
  '动作 1：哑铃深蹲（臀腿）': 'Exercise 1: Dumbbell Squat (Glutes & Legs)',
