  '动作数': 'Exercise Count',
  '动作标准优于速度：力竭时动作变形立即停止\n心率监测：高强度阶段不超过 95% 最大心率\n力竭管理：保留 1-2 次余力，不做到绝对力竭\n关节信号：膝盖/腰/肩疼痛立即停止，不是"忍一下"\n水分补充：训练前 2 小时 500ml、训练中少量多次': 'Form over speed: stop immediately when form breaks down at failure\nHeart rate monitoring: keep the high-intensity phase under 95% of max heart rate\nFailure management: keep 1-2 reps in reserve, don\'t train to absolute failure\nJoint signals: stop immediately on knee/low back/shoulder pain, don\'t just push through it\nHydration: 500ml 2 hours before training, small frequent sips during training',
  '动作热度榜': 'Top Exercises',
  '动作类型：自重/负重/混合，按全身/下肢/核心分类。\n\n选择原则：多关节、高强度、安全可控、可快速切换。\n\n推荐动作：开合跳/高抬腿/波比跳/登山者/战绳。': 'Exercise types: bodyweight/loaded/mixed, categorized by full body/lower body/core.\n\nSelection principles: multi-joint, high intensity, safe and controllable, quick to switch between.\n\nRecommended exercises: jumping jacks/high knees/burpees/mountain climbers/battle ropes.',
  '动作组合设计原则': 'Exercise Combination Design Principles',
  '动作节奏采用2-1-2-1（离心2秒-底部停1秒-向心2秒-顶峰1秒），强化离心收缩肌肉损伤机制': 'Use a 2-1-2-1 tempo (2s eccentric - 1s pause at the bottom - 2s concentric - 1s at the top) to increase muscle damage from eccentric contraction',
  '动作要到位': 'Perform the movement properly',
  '动作要标准': 'Keep Your Form Strict',
  '动作要点': 'Key Points',
  '动作要点：\n\$points\n\n': 'Key Points:\n\$points\n\n',
  '动作要领': 'Key Technique Points',
  '动作要领：仰卧垫上，双脚踩实，双手各持一铃于胸部两侧；呼气将哑铃向上推至两铃靠近，顶峰停 1 秒，再吸气缓慢下放。主练胸大肌、三角肌前束与肱三头肌。每个动作 3 组、每组 10-12 次。': 'Technique: lie on a mat with your feet planted, holding a dumbbell in each hand at the sides of your chest; exhale and press the dumbbells up until they meet, pause 1 second at the top, then inhale and lower slowly. Primarily targets the pecs, anterior deltoids, and triceps. 3 sets of 10-12 reps for each exercise.',
  '动作要领：仰卧屈膝，将哑铃放在髋骨上、双手扶住；呼气顶髋向上将臀部推起，顶峰夹紧臀部 1-2 秒，再缓慢下放。主练臀大肌。3 组、每组 15 次。发力时收紧核心，不要用腰代偿。': 'Technique: lie on your back with knees bent, place a dumbbell on the hips and hold it with both hands; exhale and drive the hips up, squeezing the glutes for 1-2 seconds at the top, then lower slowly. Primarily targets the glutes. 3 sets of 15 reps. Brace the core as you drive and don\'t let the lower back take over.',
  '动作要领：双手持铃垂于体侧，向前跨出一步，下蹲至前膝约 90 度、后膝接近地面，再蹬地回到原位，还原换腿。主练臀大肌与单腿稳定性。每侧 10-12 次、3 组。保持躯干直立，前膝不过脚尖。': 'Technique: hold dumbbells at your sides, step forward and squat until the front knee is at about 90 degrees and the back knee is close to the floor, then push back to the start and switch legs. Primarily targets the glutes and single-leg stability. 10-12 reps per side, 3 sets. Keep the torso upright and the front knee from passing the toes.',
  '动作要领：双手持铃垂于体前，微屈膝、屈髋，让哑铃沿大腿前侧缓慢下滑至小腿中段，感受大腿后侧与臀部张力，再伸髋拉起回到站立。主练腘绳肌、臀大肌、下背。3 组、每组 10-12 次。背部始终挺直。': 'Technique: hold dumbbells in front of the body with knees and hips slightly bent, let the dumbbells slide down the front of the thighs to mid-shin, feeling tension in the hamstrings and glutes, then extend the hips to return to standing. Primarily targets the hamstrings, glutes, and lower back. 3 sets of 10-12 reps. Keep the back straight throughout.',
  '动作要领：双脚与肩同宽，双手持铃停于胸前；吸气屈髋屈膝下蹲至大腿平行或略低于地面，膝盖方向与脚尖一致，呼气站起。主练股四头肌、臀大肌。3 组、每组 12-15 次。': 'Technique: feet shoulder-width apart, hold dumbbells at the chest; inhale, hinge at the hips and bend the knees to squat until the thighs are parallel to or slightly below the floor, knees tracking the toes, then exhale and stand up. Primarily targets the quadriceps and glutes. 3 sets of 12-15 reps.',
  '动作要领：双脚与肩同宽，屈髋俯身，背部挺直；双手持铃贴近身体向髋部方向拉，肩胛骨夹紧，再缓慢下放。主练背部、菱形肌与肱二头肌。3 组、每组 12 次。俯身时保持脊柱中立，避免弓腰。': 'Technique: feet shoulder-width apart, hinge at the hips with a straight back; pull the dumbbells toward the hips close to the body, squeezing the shoulder blades, then lower slowly. Primarily targets the back, rhomboids, and biceps. 3 sets of 12 reps. Keep the spine neutral while bent over and avoid rounding the lower back.',
  '动作要领：坐姿微后仰，双手持哑铃于胸前，双脚抬离地面（较难）或踩地；呼气向左右交替转动躯干，让哑铃碰触身体两侧。主练腹内外斜肌与核心旋转力。3 组、每组 20 次（左右各 10）。转动靠核心带动，不是靠摆臂。': 'Technique: sit leaning back slightly, holding a dumbbell in front of the chest, with the feet lifted off the floor (harder) or planted; exhale and rotate the torso side to side, tapping the dumbbell beside the body. Primarily targets the internal and external obliques and core rotational strength. 3 sets of 20 reps (10 per side). Rotate with the core, not by swinging the arms.',
  '动作要领：坐姿或站姿，双手持铃举至耳侧，掌心向前；呼气将哑铃垂直推起过头，直到手臂伸直，再控制下放回耳侧。主练三角肌与肱三头肌。3 组、每组 10-12 次。全程收紧核心，避免腰椎后仰代偿。': 'Technique: seated or standing, hold dumbbells at ear level with palms facing forward; exhale and press the dumbbells straight overhead until the arms are extended, then lower back to ear level under control. Primarily targets the deltoids and triceps. 3 sets of 10-12 reps. Brace the core throughout and avoid arching the lower back.',
  '动作要领：站姿或坐姿，双手持铃垂于体侧，掌心向前；呼气屈肘将哑铃举起至肩前，顶峰收缩 1 秒，再缓慢下放。主练肱二头肌。3 组、每组 12-15 次。身体不要前后摇晃借力。': 'Technique: standing or seated, hold dumbbells at your sides with palms facing forward; exhale and curl the dumbbells up to shoulder level, holding the peak contraction for 1 second, then lower slowly. Primarily targets the biceps. 3 sets of 12-15 reps. Don\'t rock the body back and forth to cheat.',
  '动作说明': 'Instructions',
  '动作质量永远优先于数量。宁可每组做 8 个标准动作，不要为追求次数而塌腰变形': 'Movement quality always comes before quantity. Better to do 8 clean reps per set than to round your back chasing more reps',
