  '协议版本 \$privacyPolicyVersion · 更新于 2026-09-10': 'Policy version \$privacyPolicyVersion · Updated 2026-09-10',
  '单杠': 'Pull-up Bar',
  '单次训练容量分配：主项 60%（如卧推 5 组）、辅助复合变式 25%（上斜哑铃 3 组）、孤立动作 15%（飞鸟 2 组）。弱链肌群每周额外加 4-6 组专项训练，可在训练末段或单独安排弱链日。例如上胸薄弱者，每周一三五训练末段加上斜哑铃飞鸟 3 组×12 次。8-12 周后评估弱链改善情况，调整专项重点。这种精准打击比"全身都练"更高效。': 'Per-session volume distribution: 60% main lift (e.g. 5 sets of bench press), 25% assistance compound variation (3 sets of incline dumbbell press), 15% isolation work (2 sets of flyes). For weak-link muscle groups, add 4-6 extra dedicated sets per week, either at the end of a session or on a separate weak-link day. For example, someone with a weak upper chest can add 3 sets × 12 reps of incline dumbbell flyes at the end of Monday, Wednesday, and Friday sessions. Reassess weak-link progress after 8-12 weeks and shift the focus. This targeted approach is far more efficient than just training everything.',
  '单腿站姿：扶墙或椅子，从 10 秒逐步过渡到 30 秒\n脚跟行走：有效强化踝关节与足底\n坐姿站起：模拟日常动作，练腿力与平衡\n闭眼站立：在安全扶持下进阶挑战': 'Single-leg stance: hold a wall or chair, progress from 10 seconds to 30 seconds\nHeel walking: effectively strengthens the ankle and sole of the foot\nSit-to-stand: mimics everyday movement, building leg strength and balance\nStanding with eyes closed: an advanced challenge with safe support',
  '单臂划': 'One-Arm Row',
