  '卧推': 'Bench Press',
  '卧推完全指南': 'The Complete Guide to the Bench Press',
  '卧推必须有保护者或使用保护杠。大重量卧推脱手是健身房最严重的事故之一，绝不能独自冲刺极限重量': 'Always bench with a spotter or safety bars. Dropping a heavy bench press is one of the most serious gym accidents — never attempt a max lift alone',
  '卧推技术要点': 'Bench Press Technique Points',
  '卧推握距1.5-2×肩宽，触胸位置在乳头至胸骨下端之间，触胸过高（锁骨位）增加肩峰下撞击风险': 'Bench press grip width 1.5-2× shoulder width; the touch point is between the nipples and the lower sternum — touching too high (clavicle level) raises the risk of subacromial impingement',
  '卧推过度起桥（腰椎超伸）增加小关节负荷，应保持臀触凳、双脚踩地的合规起桥幅度': 'Excessive arching (lumbar hyperextension) in the bench press loads the facet joints; keep a legal arch with the glutes on the bench and the feet on the floor',
