  '双手在胸前交叉，顶峰收缩1-2秒': 'Cross the hands in front of the chest and hold the peak contraction for 1-2 seconds',
  '双手在胸前交汇后保持收缩1-2秒，肩胛充分后缩，缓慢回放至起始位置，完成一次重复，全程控制。': 'After the hands meet in front of the chest, hold the contraction for 1-2 seconds with the shoulder blades fully retracted, then slowly return to the start to complete one rep, staying in control throughout.',
  '双手将杠铃从架上取出，控制杠铃位于锁骨正上方，手臂伸直不锁死，核心收紧稳定，准备下放。': 'Take the barbell out of the rack with both hands, position it directly above the clavicle, arms straight but not locked out, core braced and stable, ready to lower.',
  '双手抱头用力拉颈部': 'Pulling the neck hard with both hands behind the head',
  '双手抱头用力拉颈部完成卷腹导致颈椎损伤，应轻扶头侧或交叉胸前': 'Pulling hard on the neck with both hands behind the head during crunches can cause cervical spine injury; lightly support the sides of the head or cross the arms over the chest instead',
  '双手持哑铃于大腿前': 'Hold a dumbbell in front of your thighs with both hands',
  '双手持哑铃于身体两侧': 'Hold dumbbells at the sides of the body',
  '双手握距略宽于肩，全握杠铃（拇指环绕）': 'Grip slightly wider than shoulder width with a full grip (thumb wrapped around the bar)',
  '双手正握单杠，握距略宽于肩，身体自然悬垂，核心收紧，肩胛下沉激活背阔肌，避免死悬挂拉伤肩关节。': 'Grip the bar with an overhand grip slightly wider than shoulder width, hang naturally, brace the core, depress the shoulder blades to engage the lats, and avoid a dead hang that strains the shoulder joint.',
  '双手正握略宽于肩': 'Overhand grip slightly wider than shoulder width',
  '双手略宽于肩，掌心与胸口平齐': 'Hands slightly wider than shoulder width, palms level with the chest',
  '双手轻放耳侧不拽头': 'Rest the hands lightly beside the ears without pulling the head',
  '双方均可获得奖励。每次生成均反映你最新的训练数据。': 'Both sides receive rewards. Each generation reflects your latest training data.',
  '双方获奖': 'Rewards for Both',
  '双杠': 'Parallel Bars',
  '双杠支撑，身体微前倾刺激胸肌': 'Support on the parallel bars and lean the body slightly forward to target the chest',
  '双杠臂屈伸': 'Dips',
  '双脚与肩同宽置于踏板中上部': 'Place the feet shoulder-width apart on the middle-upper part of the platform',
  '双脚与肩同宽，微屈膝，髋部铰链俯身至上半身接近平行地面，背部保持中立，双手正握杠铃，握距略宽于肩。': 'Feet shoulder-width apart, knees slightly bent, hinge at the hips until the upper body is nearly parallel to the floor, back neutral, barbell held with an overhand grip slightly wider than shoulder width.',
  '双脚与肩同宽，脚尖外展15-30°': 'Feet shoulder-width apart, toes turned out 15-30°',
