  '双腿并拢伸直': 'Legs together and straight',
  '双腿弯曲': 'Knees bent',
  '双臂完全伸直': 'Arms fully extended',
  '双臂完全伸直，肩胛上回旋，躯干微后倾，挺胸，核心收紧，准备背阔肌发力下拉把手。': 'Arms fully extended, shoulder blades upwardly rotated, torso leaning back slightly, chest up, core braced, ready to pull the handle down with the lats.',
  '双臂展开略低于肩，肘关节微屈固定角度，掌心朝前，肩胛后缩下沉，核心收紧准备发力夹胸。': 'Arms spread slightly below shoulder height, elbows fixed at a slight bend, palms facing forward, shoulder blades retracted and depressed, core braced, ready to squeeze the chest.',
  '双臂弧形展开至与肩平齐': 'Arc the arms out until they are level with the shoulders',
  '双臂自然伸直': 'Arms naturally straight',
  '双臂自然伸直，肩胛前引，背部平直，躯干稳定不前后晃动，准备背阔肌发力后拉把手。': 'Arms naturally straight, shoulder blades protracted, back flat, torso stable without rocking back and forth, ready to pull the handle back with the lats.',
  '反向饮食期间建议同时增加训练容量（每动作多 1-2 组），将多出的热量用于肌肉合成而非脂肪储存。配合力量训练，反向饮食甚至可能带来小幅肌肉增长，让体型在维持期进一步紧致。这是减脂成功后从瘦到壮的关键过渡期，跳过它直接进入维持期，代谢会卡在低点数月难以恢复，反弹风险显著上升。': 'During a reverse diet, it\'s recommended to increase training volume at the same time (1-2 extra sets per exercise) so the extra calories go toward muscle building rather than fat storage. Combined with strength training, a reverse diet can even produce slight muscle gain, tightening your physique further during the maintenance phase. This is the critical transition from thin to strong after a successful cut; skip it and go straight into maintenance, and your metabolism can stay stuck at a low point for months, making rebound far more likely.',
  '反馈问题请附上设备型号、系统版本与问题截图': 'When reporting an issue, please include your device model, OS version, and a screenshot',
  '发力顺序：腿→臀→背': 'Force sequence: legs → glutes → back',
  '发现邀请码': 'Invite Code Found',
  '取消': 'Cancel',
  '取消所有通知': 'Cancel All Notifications',
  '取消精选': 'Remove from Featured',
  '只做下拉类动作忽视划船，背部宽度有余而厚度不足，划船类应占总拉类容量60%': 'Doing only pulldowns and neglecting rows leaves the back wide but lacking thickness — rows should make up 60% of total pulling volume',
  '只做卷腹忽视下腹与腹斜肌，腹肌发展不均衡，应分区训练上腹/下腹/腹斜/腹横': 'Doing only crunches and neglecting the lower abs and obliques leaves uneven ab development; train the upper abs/lower abs/obliques/transverse abdominis by region',
  '只做有氧忽视力量训练，导致肌肉流失、基础代谢下降，应力量为主（3-4次/周）+ 有氧为辅（2次/周LISS）': 'Doing only cardio and neglecting strength training leads to muscle loss and a drop in basal metabolism — prioritize strength (3-4x/week) with cardio as a supplement (2x/week LISS)',
  '只动手臂不转体': 'Moving only the arms without trunk rotation',
  '只爱卧推的健身狂热者': 'The fitness fanatic who only loves the bench press',
  '只练深蹲忽视硬拉，腘绳肌（双关节肌）深蹲中EMG激活有限，必须用RDL独立训练': 'Only squatting and neglecting deadlifts: the hamstrings (a biarticular muscle) show limited EMG activation in the squat, so RDLs are necessary to train them directly',
  '可以点击「训练类型」选择模板快速生成（三分化/四分化等），也可以从空开始：点右上角「+ 训练日」添加训练日，再点训练日内的「添加动作」选择动作并设置组数、次数、重量。': 'You can tap \'Training Type\' to pick a template and generate a plan quickly (3-day split/4-day split, etc.), or start from scratch: tap \'+ Training Day\' in the top right to add a training day, then tap \'Add Exercise\' within that day to choose exercises and set sets, reps, and weight.',
  '可多选': 'Multiple selection allowed',
  '可选': 'Optional',
  '可选填写，用于更精准的训练推荐': 'Optional, for more accurate training recommendations',
  '可验证其训练数据并确认成果': 'Can verify their training data and confirm the results',
  '吃力': 'Hard',
