  '合计 \${_fmtKg(totalVolume)}kg': 'Total \${_fmtKg(totalVolume)}kg',
  '同一组动作可以三种方式进阶：①加重——从徒手到背书包、到哑铃、到弹力带；②加量——每组次数或组数增加；③变难——从跪姿俯卧撑到标准俯卧撑、从双脚深蹲到单腿分腿蹲。每次只改变一个变量，避免一次性过度进阶。': 'You can progress the same exercise in three ways: (1) add load — from bodyweight to a backpack, to dumbbells, to resistance bands; (2) add volume — more reps per set or more sets; (3) make it harder — from knee push-ups to standard push-ups, from two-foot squats to split squats. Change only one variable at a time to avoid over-advancing all at once.',
