  '吸气必须到腹部，不是胸腔。胸部吸气无法形成有效的腹内压，起不到脊柱支撑作用': 'You must breathe into the belly, not the chest. Chest breathing can\'t create effective intra-abdominal pressure and won\'t support the spine',
