  '大腿贴近胸部时停顿0.5-1秒，不弹回，保持核心紧绷，臀部不离靠垫，膝关节不超脚尖。': 'Pause 0.5-1 second when the thighs approach the chest, don\'t bounce, keep the core tight, don\'t let the glutes leave the pad, and keep the knees from passing the toes.',
