  '好友在「我的激活凭证」生成 FIT-ACT 识别码发给你。凭证含加密签名的训练数据快照，可放心展示': 'Your friend generates a FIT-ACT ID code in My Activation Credential and sends it to you. The credential contains an encrypted, signed snapshot of training data, so it\'s safe to show',
