  '如果你在使用过程中遇到任何问题、觉得有不好用或存在漏洞的地方，可以通过以下方式联系开发者，也可以直接发送邮件到邮箱反馈问题，我们会积极听取并采纳你的意见，把产品做得更好。': 'If you run into any problems while using the app, or find anything awkward or buggy, you can reach the developer through the channels below, or email us directly with your feedback. We actively listen to and adopt your suggestions to make the product better.',
