  '孤立动作针对单一肌群，负荷取 60-70% 1RM，3×12-15 次，组间休息 60-90 秒。塑形期的孤立动作选择应围绕"视觉短板"展开：上胸薄弱加上斜哑铃飞鸟、侧束平坦加侧平举 4 组、腘绳不足加腿弯举、腹斜薄弱加俄罗斯转体。每个弱区每周加 2-3 组孤立，6-8 周后评估并轮换。': 'Isolation exercises target a single muscle group, using 60-70% 1RM for 3×12-15 with 60-90 seconds of rest between sets. Isolation choices in a shaping phase should revolve around visual weak points: incline dumbbell flyes for a weak upper chest, 4 sets of lateral raises for flat lateral delts, leg curls for underdeveloped hamstrings, Russian twists for weak obliques. Add 2-3 isolation sets per week for each weak area and reassess and rotate after 6-8 weeks.',
