  '完成全部组数后慢走3-5分钟冷身，进行下肢静态拉伸，补充水分和蛋白质，帮助恢复。': 'After finishing all sets, walk slowly for 3-5 minutes to cool down, do static stretching for the lower body, and rehydrate and take in protein to aid recovery.',
  '完成全部组数后慢跑或慢走5分钟冷身，进行下肢和髋部静态拉伸，防止肌肉僵硬。': 'After finishing all sets, jog or walk slowly for 5 minutes to cool down and do static stretching for the lower body and hips to prevent muscle stiffness.',
  '完成全部组数后，坡度归零慢走3-5分钟冷身，拉伸小腿、股四头和臀部，恢复肌肉弹性。': 'After finishing all sets, return the incline to zero and walk slowly for 3-5 minutes to cool down, then stretch the calves, quads, and glutes to restore muscle elasticity.',
