  '容量分配原则': 'Volume Distribution Principles',
  '容量：单肌群周容量是否在 10-20 组合理区间\n强度：主项 %1RM 是否持续进步，RPE 是否过高\n频率：每肌群每周刺激次数是否 1.5-2 次\n营养：蛋白质 1.8-2.2g/kg、热量盈余 300-500\n恢复：睡眠 7+ 小时、静息心率是否上升\n动作：连续 6 周以上未变化导致适应': 'Volume: is weekly volume per muscle group within the 10-20 set range\nIntensity: is %1RM on main lifts progressing steadily, is RPE too high\nFrequency: is each muscle group stimulated 1.5-2 times per week\nNutrition: protein 1.8-2.2g/kg, calorie surplus 300-500\nRecovery: 7+ hours of sleep, is resting heart rate rising\nExercise: no changes for 6+ weeks has led to adaptation',
  '对居家新手来说，每周 3 次、每次 25-30 分钟是最可持续的节奏，例如周一、周三、周五训练，其他时间休息。内容可以是全身循环：热身 5 分钟 + 下肢动作 3 组 + 上肢动作 3 组 + 核心动作 3 组 + 拉伸放松 5 分钟。这样既覆盖全身，又不会过度疲劳。': 'For a beginner training at home, 3 sessions of 25-30 minutes per week is the most sustainable rhythm — for example, training Monday, Wednesday, and Friday with rest on the other days. The content can be a full-body circuit: 5-minute warm-up + 3 sets of lower body + 3 sets of upper body + 3 sets of core + 5 minutes of stretching. This covers the whole body without excessive fatigue.',
