  '将跑步机坡度调整至5-8%，先慢走2分钟适应坡度，身体微前倾，激活臀部准备坡度跑。': 'Set the treadmill incline to 5-8%, walk slowly for 2 minutes to get used to the slope, lean your body slightly forward, and activate your glutes to prepare for incline running.',
