  '小提示：保存后随时可以进入计划详情继续编辑训练日与动作。': 'Tip: after saving, you can open the plan details anytime to keep editing training days and exercises.',
  '小红书': 'Xiaohongshu',
  '小腿': 'Calves',
  '小腿分化：站姿提踵4×12-15（腓肠肌，伸膝位）+ 坐姿提踵3×15-20（比目鱼肌，屈膝位）': 'Calf split: Standing Calf Raise 4x12-15 (gastrocnemius, knees extended) + Seated Calf Raise 3x15-20 (soleus, knees flexed)',
  '小腿肌群': 'Calves',
  '小腿训练被忽视或只做站姿，应区分站姿（腓肠肌）与坐姿（比目鱼肌）': 'Calf training gets neglected or limited to standing raises; you should separate standing (gastrocnemius) from seated (soleus) work',
  '小腿频率每周4-6次、每次8-12组（慢肌比例高），底端停1秒拉伸、顶端停1秒收缩杜绝弹震': 'Train calves 4-6 times per week, 8-12 sets per session (high slow-twitch fiber ratio), pause 1 second at the bottom to stretch and 1 second at the top to contract, with no bouncing',
