  '居家新手建议准备一对可调节哑铃（2.5-15kg）或两档固定重量：一组"中档"用于深蹲、推举等大肌群动作，一组"轻档"用于弯举等小肌群。判断标准：做完一组后感到最后 2-3 次吃力、但动作仍能保持标准，这个重量就是合适的。': 'For home training, beginners should get a pair of adjustable dumbbells (2.5-15 kg) or two fixed weight tiers: a "medium" pair for big muscle group moves like squats and presses, and a "light" pair for smaller muscles like curls. How to judge: after a set, the last 2-3 reps should feel hard while your form still holds up - that is the right weight.',
  '居家训练三大必备': 'Three Home Workout Essentials',
  '居家训练不需要健身房，一块瑜伽垫、一面空墙、一把椅子就能开始。本章教你如何打造属于自己的居家训练角，让训练融入日常生活。': 'Home workouts do not need a gym - a yoga mat, an empty wall and a chair are enough to start. This chapter shows you how to build your own home training corner and make training part of everyday life.',
  '居家训练真正需要的只有三样：瑜伽垫（保护关节、防滑）、运动鞋（支撑脚踝、缓冲落地）、毛巾与水（保持清洁与补水）。想增加训练乐趣，还可准备弹力带和哑铃——它们并非必需品，未来按需添置即可。记住，开始永远比装备重要，先动起来，再逐步升级装备。': 'You really only need three things at home: a yoga mat (protects joints, non-slip), training shoes (ankle support, impact cushioning), and a towel plus water (staying clean and hydrated). To make training more fun you can also add resistance bands and dumbbells - they are not required, just add them later as needed. Remember, starting always matters more than gear: get moving first, upgrade your equipment later.',
