  '常青': 'Evergreen',
  '干扰效应的本质': 'The Nature of the Interference Effect',
  '干扰效应：过量有氧抑制肌肥大与力量增长。\n\n平衡策略：力量优先 + HIIT 补充 + 间隔 6 小时。\n\n减脂期容量：力量保留至赤字前 60-80%，HIIT 2-3 次/周。': 'Interference effect: excessive cardio blunts hypertrophy and strength gains.\n\nBalancing strategy: prioritize strength + add HIIT + leave a 6-hour gap.\n\nVolume during a cut: keep strength work at 60-80% of pre-deficit levels, HIIT 2-3 times per week.',
  '平': 'Flat',
  '平举': 'Raise',
  '平台': 'Platform',
  '平台期原因：代谢适应、水分波动、热量计算误差。\n\n突破策略：重新计算TDEE、增加非运动消耗（NEAT）、安排饮食休息日（refeed）。\n\n不要：盲目继续削减热量至极低水平，会导致暴食反弹。\n\n达到目标后：用2-4周反向饮食，每周增加100大卡直至维持热量。\n\n长期维持：建立可持续的饮食习惯，允许20%的灵活食物，避免非黑即白思维。': 'Why plateaus happen: metabolic adaptation, water fluctuations, and calorie counting errors.\n\nBreakthrough strategies: recalculate TDEE, increase NEAT, and schedule refeed days.\n\nDo not: blindly keep cutting calories to extremely low levels, which leads to binge eating and rebound.\n\nAfter hitting your goal: reverse diet over 2-4 weeks, adding 100 kcal per week until you reach maintenance calories.\n\nLong-term maintenance: build sustainable eating habits, allow 20% flexible foods, and avoid all-or-nothing thinking.',
  '平台突破的非常规手段': 'Unconventional Ways to Break Through a Plateau',
  '平均休息时长': 'Average Rest Time',
  '平均时长': 'Average Duration',
  '平均每组重量': 'Average Weight per Set',
  '平均重量': 'Average Weight',
  '平坡恢复': 'Flat Recovery',
  '平板支撑': 'Plank',
  '平板支撑是核心训练的基础动作，锻炼腹横肌和深层稳定肌群。': 'The plank is a foundational core exercise that trains the transverse abdominis and the deep stabilizing muscles.',
  '平板杠铃卧推是胸部训练的王牌动作，主要刺激胸大肌中部，同时锻炼三角肌前束和肱三头肌。': 'The flat barbell bench press is the king of chest exercises, mainly targeting the mid pectoralis major while also working the front delts and triceps.',
  '平衡能力是可以练回来的': 'Balance can be trained back',
  '平衡能力随年龄自然下降，但完全可以通过训练改善。每天花 10 分钟做平衡练习，就能显著提升下肢稳定性与协调性。平衡训练还能强化核心，改善体态，让你走得更稳、站得更久。': 'Balance naturally declines with age, but it can absolutely be improved with training. Spending just 10 minutes a day on balance drills noticeably improves lower-body stability and coordination. Balance training also strengthens the core and improves posture, so you walk steadier and stand longer.',
  '平衡训练务必在扶手或椅子旁进行，确保摔倒时能及时扶住，安全永远是第一位的': 'Always do balance training next to a handrail or chair so you can catch yourself if you start to fall - safety always comes first',
  '年卡': 'Annual Pass',
  '年度长期规划': 'Long-Term Annual Planning',
  '年龄与恢复能力': 'Age and Recovery Capacity',
  '广告': 'Ad',
  '广告加载失败，请稍后重试': 'Ad failed to load, please try again later',
  '广告未观看完成': 'Ad not watched to the end',
  '广告模拟中...': 'Simulating ad...',
  '应用': 'Apply',
  '应用商店搜索': 'App Store search',
