  '掌心相对中立握': 'Neutral grip with palms facing each other',
  '掌控休息节奏': 'Own your rest tempo',
  '控制上送保持张力': 'Control the upward return, keep tension',
  '控制下放保持张力': 'Control the lowering phase to keep tension',
  '控制哑铃从顶端位置缓慢下放至体侧，三角肌中束保持张力，下放过程吸气，不自由落体。': 'Control the dumbbells as you slowly lower from the top position down to your sides, keeping tension on the lateral delts, inhaling during the descent, and never letting them free-fall.',
  '控制哑铃缓慢下放至肩部两侧，肘关节约90度，三角肌充分拉伸，下放过程吸气，保持核心稳定。': 'Slowly lower the dumbbells to the sides of your shoulders with the elbows at about 90 degrees, fully stretching the delts. Inhale as you lower and keep your core stable.',
  '控制哑铃缓慢下放至起始位置，下放过程2-3秒，保持张力，不借力甩动，完成一次重复。': 'Slowly lower the dumbbells back to the starting position over 2-3 seconds, keeping tension and not swinging the weight. That is one rep.',
  '控制哑铃缓慢下放至起始位置，下放过程2-3秒，肱二头肌保持张力，不甩动借力，完成一次重复。': 'Slowly lower the dumbbells back to the starting position over 2-3 seconds, keeping tension on the biceps and not swinging for momentum. That is one rep.',
  '控制哑铃缓慢下放至起始位置，下放过程3秒，保持张力，完成一次重复，全程不晃动借力。': 'Slowly lower the dumbbells back to the starting position over 3 seconds, keeping tension to complete the rep, with no swaying or momentum throughout.',
  '控制回放保持张力': 'Control the return, keep tension',
  '控制把手缓慢上送至双臂完全伸直，背阔肌充分拉伸，肩胛上回旋放松，上送过程吸气，保持张力。': 'Slowly let the handle back up until your arms are fully extended, fully stretching the lats, letting the shoulder blades upwardly rotate and relax. Inhale on the way up and keep tension.',
  '控制把手缓慢前送至手臂自然伸直，背阔肌充分拉伸，肩胛前引放松，背部保持平直不弓背，吸气。': 'Slowly let the handle forward until your arms are naturally extended, fully stretching the lats, letting the shoulder blades protract and relax, keeping the back flat and not rounded. Inhale.',
  '控制把手缓慢回放至双臂展开位，胸大肌充分拉伸，肘关节角度不变，吸气，保持张力不甩动。': 'Slowly let the handle back to the arms-open position, fully stretching the pecs, keeping the elbow angle unchanged. Inhale, keep tension and do not swing.',
  '控制杠铃沿垂直轨迹缓慢下放至胸大肌下缘（乳头连线），肘关节与躯干约呈75度角，下放过程吸气，全程保持张力。': 'Lower the barbell slowly along a vertical path to the lower edge of the pecs (nipple line), with the elbows at about 75 degrees to your torso. Inhale as you lower and keep tension throughout.',
  '控制杠铃沿大腿前侧缓慢下放至手臂自然伸直，背阔肌充分拉伸，下放过程保持背部中立，吸气。': 'Lower the barbell slowly along the front of your thighs until your arms are naturally extended, fully stretching the lats, keeping the back neutral as you lower. Inhale.',
  '控制杠铃沿斜上方轨迹下放至上胸部（锁骨下缘），肘关节约呈60-75度，吸气，保持张力不自由落体。': 'Lower the barbell slowly along the diagonal path back to your upper chest (lower edge of the collarbone), with the elbows at about 60-75 degrees. Inhale, keep tension and do not let it free-fall.',
  '控制肩胛缓慢下放至离地约1厘米（不贴地完全放松），吸气，保持张力，完成一次重复。': 'Slowly lower the shoulder blades to about 1 cm off the floor (do not relax completely on the floor). Inhale, keep tension, and complete the rep.',
  '控制踏板缓慢下放至大腿贴近胸部（膝关节约90度），下放过程吸气，核心收紧，膝盖不内扣。': 'Slowly let the platform back until your thighs come toward your chest (knees at about 90 degrees). Inhale as you lower, brace your core, and do not let the knees cave in.',
  '控制速度，不借力甩动': 'Control the speed, no swinging for momentum',
  '控制速度，感受腹斜肌发力': 'Control the speed and feel your obliques working',
  '推举': 'Press',
  '推拉腿 PPL：每肌群 2 次/周，容量 12-16 组，恢复要求高\n上下肢：每肌群 2 次/周，容量 14-18 组，平衡稳定\n五分化：每肌群 1 次/周，容量 16-20 组，单次容量大\n六分化：每肌群 1 次/周+弱项日，容量 18-22 组，极致专项': 'Push/pull/legs (PPL): 2x per muscle group per week, 12-16 sets, high recovery demands\nUpper/lower: 2x per muscle group per week, 14-18 sets, balanced and stable\n5-way split: 1x per muscle group per week, 16-20 sets, high volume per session\n6-way split: 1x per muscle group per week plus a weak-point day, 18-22 sets, maximum specialization',
  '推拉腿分化（每周 6 次），适合中阶训练者追求肌肥大\n力量计划 5x5（每周 3 次），专注大重量复合动作\n上下肢分化（每周 4 次），平衡频率与恢复\n功能训练或专项运动迁移，提升运动表现\n持续学习新动作与技术，避免训练单调': 'Push/pull/legs split (6 days a week), for intermediate trainees chasing hypertrophy\n5x5 strength program (3 days a week), focused on heavy compound lifts\nUpper/lower split (4 days a week), balancing frequency and recovery\nFunctional training or sport-specific work to boost athletic performance\nKeep learning new movements and techniques so training never gets boring',
  '推拉腿训练计划': 'Push/Pull/Legs Program',
  '推拉腿（PPL）分化：推日（胸/肩/三头）、拉日（背/二头）、腿日（腿/核心），每肌群每周训练2次': 'Push/pull/legs (PPL) split: push day (chest/shoulders/triceps), pull day (back/biceps), leg day (legs/core), training each muscle group twice a week',
  '推日训练量过大（>12组胸/肩）导致肩部疲劳累积影响拉日表现': 'Too much push-day volume (>12 sets for chest/shoulders) accumulates shoulder fatigue and hurts pull-day performance',
  '推至头顶上方，肘部伸展': 'Press overhead, extend the elbows',
  '推至手臂自然伸直（不锁死肘关节），杠铃位于肩关节正上方，肩胛保持后缩下沉，完成一次重复，准备下次下放。': 'Press until your arms are naturally straight (do not lock out the elbows), with the barbell directly over the shoulder joint and the shoulder blades retracted and depressed. That is one rep - get ready for the next lowering phase.',
  '推至手臂自然伸直（不锁死），哑铃在头顶上方靠近但不触碰，肩胛稳定，完成一次重复。': 'Press until your arms are naturally straight (do not lock out), with the dumbbells close together overhead but not touching, and the shoulder blades stable. That is one rep.',
  '推至手臂自然伸直（不锁死），杠铃回到锁骨正上方，完成一次重复，注意角度过大会变平板卧推。': 'Press until your arms are naturally straight (do not lock out) and the barbell returns directly over your collarbone. That is one rep - note that too steep an angle turns it into a flat bench press.',
