  '早餐吃足蛋白质启动肌肉合成，训练前 1-2 小时摄入碳水提供能量，训练后 30 分钟内补充快吸收蛋白 + 碳水启动恢复，睡前可摄入酪蛋白（牛奶/希腊酸奶）缓慢释放氨基酸。这些细节不是必须严格遵守的法则，但在减脂后期低热量状态下，优化时机能让有限的营养发挥最大效果。在热量缺口中，每一次营养摄入都值得被认真对待。': 'Eat enough protein at breakfast to kick off muscle protein synthesis, have carbs 1-2 hours before training for energy, and within 30 minutes after training take fast-digesting protein plus carbs to start recovery; before bed you can have casein (milk/Greek yogurt) for a slow release of amino acids. These details are not hard rules, but in the late stages of a cut when calories are low, better timing gets the most out of limited nutrients. In a calorie deficit, every bit of nutrition deserves to be taken seriously.',
