  '晨起静息心率上升 5-10 次/分（基线对比）\n握力下降 10% 以上（手持测力计或悬挂测试）\n连续 2 周主项力量退步\n睡眠质量变差，多梦或早醒\n小伤口恢复变慢，易感冒\n训练动力降低，"练不动"感持续 1 周以上': 'Morning resting heart rate up 5-10 bpm (vs. baseline)\nGrip strength down more than 10% (hand dynamometer or hang test)\nMain lift strength declining for 2 consecutive weeks\nWorse sleep quality, vivid dreams or waking up early\nSmall wounds heal more slowly, catching colds more easily\nLower training motivation, feeling "can\'t push" for more than a week',
