  '有氧': 'Cardio',
  '有氧与力量的平衡': 'Balancing Cardio and Strength',
  '有氧和力量存在"干扰效应"——过量有氧会抑制肌肥大和力量增长。健康训练者需平衡：①力量训练日与有氧日间隔 6 小时以上或分日进行；②有氧单次不超过 45 分钟；③优先低冲击有氧；④每周有氧总量不超过 4 小时。这样的安排能同时获得心肺和力量收益，又不过度消耗恢复能力。健康训练不是单项突破，而是全面平衡。': 'Cardio and strength training have an "interference effect" — excessive cardio blunts hypertrophy and strength gains. Healthy trainees need balance: ①Separate strength and cardio days, or leave 6+ hours between them; ②Keep single cardio sessions under 45 minutes; ③Prefer low-impact cardio; ④Cap total cardio at 4 hours per week. This setup delivers both cardiovascular and strength benefits without draining recovery capacity. Healthy training is not about maxing out one quality — it is about overall balance.',
  '有氧选择：低冲击（骑行/坡度走）优于高冲击（跑步），Wilson 2012 meta高冲击使肌肥大效益降31%、力量降18%': 'Cardio choice: low impact (cycling/incline walking) beats high impact (running). Wilson 2012 meta: high impact reduces hypertrophy benefits by 31% and strength by 18%',
