  '标准弯举': 'Standard Curl',
  '标准徽章': 'Standard Badge',
  '标准节奏 2-1-2-1：单次 6 秒，适合大多数复合动作\n强调离心 4-1-1-1：单次 7 秒，针对肌肉增长平台\n顶峰收缩 2-1-1-3：强化顶峰感，适合孤立动作\n慢速控制 5-2-2-1：单次 10 秒，减载期使用保护关节': 'Standard tempo 2-1-2-1: 6 seconds per rep, suits most compound lifts\nEccentric emphasis 4-1-1-1: 7 seconds per rep, for breaking hypertrophy plateaus\nPeak contraction 2-1-1-3: strengthens the peak squeeze, suits isolation work\nSlow control 5-2-2-1: 10 seconds per rep, used during deloads to protect joints',
  '标记为精选': 'Mark as Featured',
  '标记精选': 'Mark as Featured',
  '校验中...': 'Verifying...',
  '校验识别码': 'Verify Identification Code',
  '核': 'Core',
  '核心': 'Core',
  '核心不仅是腹肌，而是腹直肌、腹斜肌、腹横肌、竖脊肌、多裂肌的协同。除了大重量复合动作本身，建议每周加 2 次专门的核心训练：平板支撑 3×45 秒、死虫式 3×10、Pallof Press 3×10。这些动作强化深层稳定肌，提升瓦式呼吸的加压效率。卷腹和俄罗斯转体主要练浅层腹肌，对力量训练的核心稳定帮助有限。': 'The core is more than just abs — it is the coordinated work of the rectus abdominis, obliques, transverse abdominis, erector spinae, and multifidus. Beyond heavy compound lifts themselves, add 2 dedicated core sessions per week: plank 3×45 sec, dead bug 3×10, Pallof press 3×10. These strengthen the deep stabilizers and improve the pressure-generating efficiency of the Valsalva maneuver. Crunches and Russian twists mainly train the superficial abs and do little for the core stability needed in strength training.',
  '核心功能': 'Core Features',
  '核心加压三步法': 'The Three-Step Core Bracing Method',
  '核心动作：俄罗斯转体（腹）': 'Core Exercise: Russian Twist (Abs)',
  '核心持续收紧': 'Core constantly engaged',
  '核心持续收紧，腹部激活，骨盆中立位，肩部远离耳朵，保持均匀呼吸不憋气，维持身体平直。': 'Core constantly engaged, abs activated, pelvis neutral, shoulders away from the ears, breathing steadily without holding your breath, body kept straight.',
  '核心收紧不塌腰': 'Core engaged, no lower back sag',
  '核心收紧抬起骨盆，身体从头部到脚跟呈一条直线，臀部不撅起不塌陷，颈部中立不抬头。': 'Brace the core and lift the pelvis so the body forms a straight line from head to heels; do not hike the hips up or let them sag; keep the neck neutral and the head down.',
  '核心收紧挺胸': 'Core engaged, chest up',
  '核心收紧摆臂放松': 'Core engaged, relaxed arm swing',
  '核心收紧稳定': 'Core engaged and stable',
  '核心收紧臀部发力': 'Core engaged, drive through the glutes',
  '核心收紧避免死悬挂': 'Core engaged, avoid a dead hang',
  '核心收紧，臀部不抬起': 'Core engaged, hips stay down',
  '核心是连接上下半身的桥梁。本章补充核心动作图解，并给你的 8 个哑铃动作编排成一套完整居家训练计划。': 'The core is the bridge connecting the upper and lower body. This chapter adds illustrated core exercises and arranges your 8 dumbbell movements into a complete home workout plan.',
  '核心稳定不塌腰': 'Core stable, no lower back sag',
  '核心稳定的辅助训练': 'Accessory Training for Core Stability',
  '核心肌群': 'Core Muscles',
  '根据你的信息，我们为你精选了以下训练计划': 'Based on your information, we have handpicked these training plans for you',
  '根据你的目标定制专属训练方案': 'Build a training plan tailored to your goals',
  '根据您的历史组间休息偏好, 推荐休息时间 \$recommended 秒': 'Based on your past rest preferences, recommended rest time: \$recommended seconds',
  '根据系统设置自动切换日间/夜间': 'Automatically switch between day and night based on system settings',
  '根据诊断结果分型施策：①容量不足型（< 10 组/肌群/周）→ 增加 2-4 组；②强度不足型（长期 RPE < 7）→ 提升主项强度；③频率不足型（每肌群每周 1 次）→ 改为 2 次分化；④营养不足型（蛋白质 < 1.6g/kg）→ 调整饮食；⑤恢复不足型（睡眠 < 7 小时）→ 优先解决睡眠；⑥动作适应型（6+ 周未变）→ 轮换变式。精准诊断比盲目加量有效 10 倍。': 'Apply targeted fixes based on the diagnosis: ①Insufficient volume (< 10 sets/muscle/week) → add 2-4 sets; ②Insufficient intensity (long-term RPE < 7) → raise main lift intensity; ③Insufficient frequency (once per muscle per week) → switch to a twice-weekly split; ④Insufficient nutrition (protein < 1.6g/kg) → adjust diet; ⑤Insufficient recovery (sleep < 7 hours) → fix sleep first; ⑥Movement adaptation (no change in 6+ weeks) → rotate variations. Precise diagnosis is 10x more effective than blindly adding volume.',
