  '步骤描述': 'Step Description',
  '步骤标题': 'Step Title',
  '死虫式': 'Dead Bug',
  '每 3 周切换一次节奏：第 1-2 周用标准 2-1-2-1 建立基础、第 3 周用 4-1-1-1 强调离心突破、第 4 周减量恢复。这种节奏周期化能在不增加重量的情况下持续提供新刺激，避免适应。同时节奏变化也降低了关节负荷，适合塑形期长期执行。切换节奏时重量取原 1RM 的 80-85%，避免因节奏延长导致力竭过早。': 'Switch tempo every 3 weeks: weeks 1-2 use the standard 2-1-2-1 to build a base, week 3 uses 4-1-1-1 to emphasize the eccentric and break through, week 4 deloads for recovery. This tempo periodization keeps delivering new stimuli without adding weight, avoiding adaptation. Tempo changes also reduce joint load, making them sustainable through a long shaping phase. When switching tempo, use 80-85% of your original 1RM so the longer tempo does not cause early failure.',
  '每 4-6 周安排一次减量周，重量降至平时的 60%，组数减半，让神经系统和结缔组织充分恢复。这是预防过度训练、突破平台期的关键策略。很多训练者在 deload 后迎来了力量跳升——之前的停滞不是因为练得不够，而是恢复不足。如果你最近 2 周训练表现下降、睡眠变差、心率上升，可能就是身体在呼喊 deload。': 'Schedule a deload week every 4-6 weeks: drop the weight to 60% of normal and halve the sets so the nervous system and connective tissue fully recover. This is the key strategy for preventing overtraining and breaking plateaus. Many trainees hit a strength jump after a deload — the earlier stall was not from undertraining, it was from under-recovering. If your performance has dropped over the past 2 weeks, your sleep has worsened, and your heart rate is up, your body is probably calling for a deload.',
  '每15-20分钟补水100-150ml，每45分钟补充能量胶或电解质，防止脱水和糖原耗尽。': 'Drink 100-150ml every 15-20 minutes, and take an energy gel or electrolytes every 45 minutes to prevent dehydration and glycogen depletion.',
  '每15-20分钟适量补水（每次100-150ml），保持电解质平衡，注意心率不超过70%最大值。': 'Drink 100-150ml of water every 15-20 minutes to maintain electrolyte balance, and keep your heart rate below 70% of max.',
  '每一次举起，都是对自我的超越。继续加油！': 'Every lift is a step beyond yourself. Keep going!',
  '每一次训练，都让你离目标更近一步。': 'Every workout brings you one step closer to your goal.',
  '每一滴汗水，都算数': 'Every Drop of Sweat Counts',
  '每个动作 3-4 组、每组 8-12 次、组间休息 60-90 秒是增肌黄金区间。重量选择应以最后 2-3 次感到吃力但能保持标准动作为准——也就是 RIR（保留次数）在 1-2 次之间。如果第 12 次还能轻松完成，说明重量太轻；如果第 8 次动作就开始变形，说明重量太重。每个肌群每周总组数建议 10-20 组，过多反而抑制恢复、增加受伤风险。': '3-4 sets of 8-12 reps per exercise with 60-90 seconds rest between sets is the hypertrophy sweet spot. Choose a weight where the last 2-3 reps feel hard but form stays clean — that is, an RIR (reps in reserve) of 1-2. If rep 12 is still easy, the weight is too light; if form breaks down by rep 8, it is too heavy. Aim for 10-20 total sets per muscle group per week; more than that hinders recovery and raises injury risk.',
  '每个动作组数>6组产生"垃圾容量"（junk volume）降低训练质量，单动作4组即可': 'Doing more than 6 sets per exercise creates "junk volume" and lowers training quality — 4 sets per exercise is enough',
  '每个动作组间的默认休息秒数': 'Default rest seconds between sets',
  '每个动作都有详细步骤和要点说明': 'Every exercise comes with detailed steps and key cues',
  '每个训练日5-7个动作，总组数18-25组，主项以6-10次为主，孤立动作12-15次': '5-7 exercises per training day, 18-25 total sets, 6-10 reps for main lifts and 12-15 reps for isolation work',
  '每公斤体重 1.6-2.2 克蛋白质是增肌期的标准摄入量，70kg 的人每天需要 112-154 克。将总量分散到 4-5 餐摄入，单次 20-40 克蛋白质可最大化肌肉蛋白合成反应——一次性吃太多反而利用率下降。优质来源包括鸡胸肉、鱼虾、鸡蛋清、瘦牛肉、希腊酸奶、乳清蛋白粉。补剂是补充而不是替代，食物优先的原则不能丢。': '1.6-2.2 grams of protein per kg of body weight is the standard intake for a muscle-gain phase — a 70kg person needs 112-154 grams per day. Spread the total across 4-5 meals; 20-40 grams of protein per sitting maximizes the muscle protein synthesis response, since eating too much at once lowers utilization. Quality sources include chicken breast, fish and shrimp, egg whites, lean beef, Greek yogurt, and whey protein powder. Supplements supplement rather than replace, and food always comes first.',
  '每周 3 次、每次 25-30 分钟，是居家新手最可持续的训练频率。本章教你规划时间、安排训练日，并掌握养成健身习惯的实用方法。': '3 sessions of 25-30 minutes per week is the most sustainable training frequency for a home beginner. This chapter shows you how to plan your time, schedule your training days, and use practical methods to build a lasting fitness habit.',
  '每周 3 次的黄金频率': 'The Golden Frequency: 3 Times a Week',
  '每周 4 次训练 + 3 次休息，休息日不连续安排（推荐周三、周六、周日休息）。塑形期若在热量缺口中，可考虑降至每周 3 次以保护恢复能力。睡眠必须保证 7 小时以上，蛋白质 1.8-2.2g/kg。如果出现连续 2 周力量下降、晨起心率上升 5 次以上，立即安排减量周。': '4 training days + 3 rest days per week, with rest days not consecutive (Wednesday, Saturday, and Sunday recommended). If you are in a caloric deficit during a shaping phase, consider dropping to 3 sessions per week to protect recovery. Sleep must be at least 7 hours and protein 1.8-2.2g/kg. If strength drops for 2 consecutive weeks or morning heart rate rises by 5+ beats, schedule a deload week immediately.',
  '每周\${plan.recommendedFrequency}练': '\${plan.recommendedFrequency} workouts per week',
  '每周\${plan.recommendedFrequency}练 · ': '\${plan.recommendedFrequency} workouts per week · ',
  '每周6天（PPL×2）或3天（单循环），单肌群周容量10-20组符合Schoenfeld肌肥大meta分析区间': '6 days per week (PPL×2) or 3 days (single cycle); 10-20 sets per muscle group per week falls within the Schoenfeld hypertrophy meta-analysis range',
  '每周练 2-3 次，给肌肉 48 小时恢复；动作标准优先，重量循序渐进': 'Train 2-3 times per week, giving muscles 48 hours to recover; prioritize proper form and increase the weight gradually',
  '每天在此时间推送训练提醒': 'Send a workout reminder at this time every day',
  '每天练腹（>5次/周）忽视48小时恢复期，反而影响肌肥大与神经适应': 'Training abs every day (>5x/week) ignores the 48-hour recovery window and actually hurts hypertrophy and neural adaptation',
  '每天首次签到 +\${PointsService.checkInPoints} 积分': 'First check-in each day: +\${PointsService.checkInPoints} points',
  '每日 10 分钟平衡训练': '10 Minutes of Balance Training Daily',
  '每日 2-3 升水，训练时少量多次补充，避免一次大量饮水\n训练前 1-2 小时摄入碳水餐，提供训练能量\n训练后 30 分钟内补充蛋白 + 碳水，启动恢复\n睡前可摄入酪蛋白（牛奶/希腊酸奶），缓慢释放氨基酸\n不必过度纠结补剂，食物永远是基础，蛋白粉和肌酸是补充': '2-3 liters of water daily, sipping small amounts during training instead of chugging large volumes at once\nEat a carb meal 1-2 hours before training to fuel the session\nTake protein + carbs within 30 minutes after training to kick off recovery\nHave casein before bed (milk/Greek yogurt) for a slow release of amino acids\nDo not obsess over supplements — food is always the foundation; protein powder and creatine are just supplements',
  '每日 20:00 的智能训练提醒': 'Smart workout reminder at 20:00 every day',
  '每日 25-30 克纤维，蔬菜为主（绿叶菜、西兰花、蘑菇）\n蔬菜热量极低可大量吃，是减脂期的饱腹神器\n每日 2-3 升水，水分参与脂肪代谢\n饭前 500ml 水可增加饱腹感、减少进食量\n坚决避免含糖饮料和果汁，液体热量是减脂最大的陷阱': '25-30 grams of fiber daily, mostly from vegetables (leafy greens, broccoli, mushrooms)\nVegetables are extremely low in calories so you can eat plenty — the ultimate satiety tool during a cut\n2-3 liters of water daily; water is involved in fat metabolism\n500ml of water before meals increases fullness and reduces food intake\nAvoid sugary drinks and juice entirely — liquid calories are the biggest trap in fat loss',
  '每日 300-500 大卡缺口，每周减 0.5-1 磅（约 0.25-0.5kg）脂肪为宜。体重下降过快（每周超过 1% 体重）意味着肌肉大量流失，后期反弹风险极高。减脂期必须配合力量训练保肌肉，否则减下来的体重中有相当比例是肌肉，导致代谢进一步下降、体型松垮。蛋白质摄入要提高到每公斤体重 2 克以上，给身体保留肌肉的明确信号。': 'A daily deficit of 300-500 kcal, losing 0.5-1 pound (about 0.25-0.5kg) of fat per week, is ideal. Losing weight too fast (more than 1% of body weight per week) means heavy muscle loss and a very high rebound risk later. Fat loss must be paired with strength training to preserve muscle — otherwise a large share of the weight you lose is muscle, which further lowers your metabolism and leaves you looking soft. Raise protein intake above 2 grams per kg of body weight to send your body a clear signal to hold on to muscle.',
  '每日定时训练提醒通知': 'Daily scheduled workout reminder',
  '每日签到': 'Daily Check-in',
  '每日训练': 'Daily Training',
  '每日训练提醒': 'Daily Workout Reminder',
  '每日训练提醒时间': 'Daily Workout Reminder Time',
  '每日贴士 · \${tip[\'category\']}': 'Daily Tip · \${tip[\'category\']}',
  '每次力量训练 20-30 分钟、每周 2-3 次即可，组间充分休息，宁轻勿重': '20-30 minutes of strength training per session, 2-3 times per week, with full rest between sets — better too light than too heavy',
  '每次训练使用相同重量，缺乏渐进超负荷，应记录AMRAP次数驱动下次加重决策': 'Using the same weight every session means no progressive overload; log your AMRAP reps to drive the next load increase',
  '每组冲刺间充分休息2-3分钟，心率降至60%以下，进行4-6组，确保每组保持最大速度。': 'Rest fully 2-3 minutes between sprints until your heart rate drops below 60%; do 4-6 sets, keeping maximum speed on every one.',
