  '法式推举': 'French Press',
  '波比跳': 'Burpee',
  '波比跳是 HIIT 的"动作之王"，但也是强度最高的动作。初学者先用简易波比（去掉俯卧撑和跳跃）建立基础': 'The burpee is the "king of exercises" in HIIT, but it is also the most intense move. Beginners should start with a simplified burpee (no push-up, no jump) to build a base',
