  '海报生成失败：\$e': 'Failed to generate poster: \$e',
  '消耗': 'Calories',
  '消耗 \$pointsCost 积分解锁': 'Spend \$pointsCost points to unlock',
  '消耗卡路里': 'Calories Burned',
  '深层稳定肌群': 'Deep Stabilizer Muscles',
  '深蹲': 'Squat',
  '深蹲"膝盖不过脚尖"误区（源自1970s单一研究）：低杠/踝背屈受限者需适度过脚尖，应关注重心落足中': 'The squat myth "knees should not pass the toes" (from a single 1970s study): low-bar lifters or those with limited ankle dorsiflexion need some knee travel; focus on keeping the weight over mid-foot',
  '深蹲/卧推/硬拉/引体/推举为五大基础复合\n负荷取 75-82% 1RM，5×6-8 次，组间休息 2-3 分钟\n每周 2 次频率，每次取 2-3 个复合动作\n保留 1-2 RIR，避免绝对力竭损害后续训练\n复合动作的进步是塑形成功的核心信号': 'Squat/bench press/deadlift/pull-up/overhead press are the five foundational compound lifts\nLoad at 75-82% 1RM, 5×6-8 reps, 2-3 minutes rest between sets\nTwice per week, taking 2-3 compound lifts each session\nKeep 1-2 RIR and avoid absolute failure that compromises later sessions\nProgress on compound lifts is the core signal that a shaping phase is working',
  '深蹲、箭步蹲、臀桥是居家下肢训练的黄金三件套。深蹲练臀腿整体力量，箭步蹲练单腿稳定与平衡，臀桥专注臀部激活。三者组合能全面刺激下肢，且都无需器械。动作要点：深蹲时膝盖与脚尖同向、下蹲至大腿平行地面；箭步蹲保持躯干直立；臀桥顶峰夹紧臀部 1 秒。': 'Squats, lunges, and hip thrusts are the golden trio of at-home lower-body training. Squats build overall hip and leg strength, lunges build single-leg stability and balance, and hip thrusts target glute activation. Together they work the entire lower body with no equipment needed. Key points: keep the knees tracking over the toes and squat to parallel; keep the torso upright in the lunge; squeeze the glutes for 1 second at the top of the hip thrust.',
  '深蹲伸肌需求守恒：膝+髋伸肌力矩=负荷×股骨长度×cos(股骨角度)，杠位/站距/举重鞋只改变髋膝分配不变总需求': 'Squat extensor demand is conserved: knee + hip extensor torque = load × femur length × cos(femur angle); bar position, stance width, and lifting shoes only shift the hip/knee split, not total demand',
  '深蹲底部"骨盆眨眼"（腰椎屈曲+骨盆后倾）增加椎间剪切力，需评估踝背屈与髋活动度': '"Butt wink" at the bottom of a squat (lumbar flexion + posterior pelvic tilt) increases intervertebral shear force — assess ankle dorsiflexion and hip mobility',
  '深蹲技术要点': 'Squat Technique Essentials',
  '深蹲是腿部训练之王，全面刺激股四头肌、臀大肌和核心肌群。': 'The squat is the king of leg exercises, working the quads, glutes, and core muscles.',
  '深蹲架 / 卧推架 / 硬拉台': 'Squat Rack / Bench Press Rack / Deadlift Platform',
  '深蹲架：主练股四头肌、臀大肌、竖脊肌（扛杠铃下蹲，全身力量之王）\n卧推架：主练胸大肌、三角肌前束、肱三头肌（平板/上斜卧推背）\n硬拉台：主练臀腿、背部、后链（罗马尼亚硬拉/传统硬拉）\n哑铃区：可练全身任意部位，适合单侧与修正不平衡': 'Squat rack: targets the quads, glutes, and erector spinae (barbell back squat — the king of full-body strength)\nBench press rack: targets the chest, front delts, and triceps (flat/incline bench press)\nDeadlift platform: targets the hips and legs, back, and posterior chain (Romanian deadlift/conventional deadlift)\nDumbbell area: works any body part, ideal for unilateral work and fixing imbalances',
  '深蹲每周 3 次是 LP 的核心。频繁的训练刺激加速神经适应，是初学者力量快速增长的关键': 'Squatting 3 times per week is the core of LP. Frequent training stimulus accelerates neural adaptation, which is the key to rapid strength gains for beginners',
  '深蹲深度不足（大腿未平行地面）使股四头肌刺激不充分，髋膝伸肌总需求不变只改变分配': 'Insufficient squat depth (thighs not parallel to the floor) under-stimulates the quads; total hip and knee extensor demand is unchanged, only the distribution shifts',
  '深蹲跳': 'Squat Jump',
  '深蹲髋膝力矩分配：高杠位膝矩大（股四头主导），低杠位髋矩大（臀大肌/腘绳肌主导）': 'Squat hip/knee torque distribution: a high bar position means more knee torque (quad-dominant), a low bar position means more hip torque (glute/hamstring-dominant)',
  '深蹲（下肢力量）、卧推（上肢推力）、硬拉（后链力量）覆盖全身主要肌群，是力量训练的基石。三大项均为多关节复合动作，能加载最大重量、激活最多运动单位、产生最强的神经适应。力量训练计划的 70% 应围绕三大项及其变式展开，剩余 30% 用于辅助动作补足弱链。脱离三大项谈力量训练，等于建空中楼阁。': 'The squat (lower-body strength), bench press (upper-body push), and deadlift (posterior chain strength) cover all major muscle groups and are the cornerstones of strength training. All three are multi-joint compound lifts that can load the most weight, activate the most motor units, and produce the strongest neural adaptation. About 70% of a strength program should revolve around the big three and their variations, with the remaining 30% going to accessory work that shores up weak links. Talking about strength training without the big three is like building a castle in the air.',
  '深蹲：高杠位、髋膝同步、深度至大腿平行。\n\n卧推：肩胛后缩、足跟蹬地、触胸推起。\n\n硬拉：杠铃贴胫、髋部铰链、脊柱中立。\n\n共性：呼吸加压、脊柱中立、控制离心。': 'Squat: high bar position, hips and knees moving together, depth to parallel.\n\nBench press: retract the shoulder blades, drive through the heels, touch the chest and press.\n\nDeadlift: bar against the shins, hip hinge, neutral spine.\n\nCommon ground: breathing and bracing, neutral spine, controlled eccentric.',
