  '用完器械归位，杠铃片卸下放回架\n自带毛巾，擦干留在器械上的汗水\n不长时间占用热门器械，组间休息时让别人插空\n训练时不大声呼喊或摔砸器械\n使用更衣室保持整洁，淋浴后清理排水口': 'Re-rack equipment when you are done and unload plates back onto the rack\nBring your own towel and wipe down sweat left on equipment\nDo not hog popular machines; let others work in during your rest periods\nDo not shout or slam equipment during training\nKeep the locker room tidy and clear the drain after showering',
