  '碳水与脂肪的平衡': 'Balancing Carbs and Fats',
  '碳水是剩余热量的分配对象。训练日多碳水（提供训练能量、补充糖原）、休息日少碳水（降低总热量）的碳水循环策略，能在保肌肉的同时加速减脂。优质碳水来源包括燕麦、糙米、红薯、全麦面包、藜麦、土豆。避免精制糖和精制碳水（白面包、糕点、含糖饮料），它们 GI 高、饱腹感差、容易引起血糖波动和暴食。': 'Carbs are where the remaining calories go. A carb-cycling approach — more carbs on training days (to fuel training and refill glycogen), fewer on rest days (to lower total calories) — speeds up fat loss while preserving muscle. Quality carb sources include oats, brown rice, sweet potatoes, whole wheat bread, quinoa, and potatoes. Avoid refined sugars and refined carbs (white bread, pastries, sugary drinks): they are high GI, poorly filling, and prone to causing blood sugar swings and binge eating.',
  '碳水是训练的主要能量来源，长期低碳会显著降低训练表现与肌肉饱满度。训练前后补充碳水（如燕麦、米饭、红薯）能提升训练表现并促进恢复，每公斤体重 3-5 克是基础范围。脂肪占总热量的 20-30%，优选不饱和脂肪（坚果、鱼油、橄榄油、牛油果），饱和脂肪适度即可。脂肪摄入不足会直接降低睾酮水平，影响增肌效率。': 'Carbs are the main fuel for training; chronically low carb intake significantly hurts performance and muscle fullness. Eating carbs (oats, rice, sweet potatoes) before and after training improves performance and recovery — 3-5 grams per kg of body weight is the baseline range. Fat should make up 20-30% of total calories, favoring unsaturated fats (nuts, fish oil, olive oil, avocado), with saturated fat kept moderate. Insufficient fat intake directly lowers testosterone and hurts muscle-building efficiency.',
