  '站于绳索机双侧滑轮之间，双脚前后弓步站立稳定重心，双手握住D型把手，身体微前倾，挺胸收腹，核心收紧。': 'Stand between the dual pulleys of a cable machine with your feet in a front-to-back split stance to stabilize your center of gravity. Grip a D-handle in each hand, lean the torso slightly forward, keep the chest up and core braced.',
  '站姿持哑铃于身体两侧，掌心向前': 'Stand holding dumbbells at your sides, palms facing forward',
  '站姿持哑铃，掌心相对（中立握）': 'Stand holding dumbbells with palms facing each other (neutral grip)',
  '站姿，双脚与肩同宽，双手各持哑铃于体侧，掌心朝向大腿，肘关节微屈约10-20度，挺胸收腹，核心收紧。': 'Stand with feet shoulder-width apart, holding a dumbbell in each hand at your sides, palms facing your thighs, elbows slightly bent about 10-20 degrees, chest up, core braced and engaged.',
  '站姿，双脚与肩同宽，双手各持哑铃自然下垂于体侧，掌心朝前，肘关节微屈并贴紧躯干，挺胸收腹。': 'Stand with feet shoulder-width apart, holding a dumbbell in each hand hanging naturally at your sides, palms facing forward, elbows slightly bent and tucked against the torso, chest up and core in.',
  '站姿，双脚与肩同宽，双手各持哑铃自然下垂于体侧，掌心相对（中立握），肘关节微屈贴身，挺胸收腹。': 'Stand with feet shoulder-width apart, holding a dumbbell in each hand hanging naturally at your sides, palms facing each other (neutral grip), elbows slightly bent and close to the body, chest up and core in.',
  '站立与肩同宽，杠铃贴近大腿': 'Stand shoulder-width apart with the barbell close to your thighs',
  '站起至髋膝完全伸展（不锁死膝关节），核心收紧，挺胸，完成一次重复，注意全程背部中立。': 'Stand up until the hips and knees are fully extended (without locking the knees), brace the core, keep the chest up and complete the rep, maintaining a neutral back throughout.',
