  '第 1 周积累：每肌群 16 组/周，强度 75% 1RM，RPE 7\n第 2 周积累：每肌群 18 组/周，强度 77.5% 1RM，RPE 8\n第 3 周积累：每肌群 20 组/周，强度 80% 1RM，RPE 9\n第 4 周减量：每肌群 10 组/周，强度 70% 1RM，RPE 6': 'Week 1 Accumulation: 16 sets/muscle/week, intensity 75% 1RM, RPE 7\nWeek 2 Accumulation: 18 sets/muscle/week, intensity 77.5% 1RM, RPE 8\nWeek 3 Accumulation: 20 sets/muscle/week, intensity 80% 1RM, RPE 9\nWeek 4 Deload: 10 sets/muscle/week, intensity 70% 1RM, RPE 6',
  '第 1 周累加：主项取 75% 1RM，5×6 次，建立基线\n第 2 周累加：主项取 77.5% 1RM，5×7 次，加 1 组辅助\n第 3 周累加：主项取 80% 1RM，5×8 次，加 2 组辅助\n第 4 周减量：主项取 70% 1RM，3×5 次，辅助组数减半': 'Week 1 Accumulation: main lift at 75% 1RM, 5×6 reps, establish a baseline\nWeek 2 Accumulation: main lift at 77.5% 1RM, 5×7 reps, add 1 accessory set\nWeek 3 Accumulation: main lift at 80% 1RM, 5×8 reps, add 2 accessory sets\nWeek 4 Deload: main lift at 70% 1RM, 3×5 reps, accessory sets halved',
  '第 1 步吸气：用腹部深吸一口气，腹部鼓起而非胸腔扩张\n第 2 步屏气：闭气准备发力，同时收紧腹肌如防御拳击\n第 3 步发力：维持加压完成一次重复，顶部吐气换气': 'Step 1 Inhale: take a deep breath into the belly, letting the abdomen expand rather than the chest\nStep 2 Hold: hold the breath and brace to produce force, tightening the abs as if bracing for a punch\nStep 3 Execute: maintain the pressure through one rep, then exhale and breathe at the top',
