  '第6天为"弱项强化日"，针对个人薄弱肌群进行专项突破（如小腿/前臂/腹肌/上胸）': 'Day 6 is a "Weak Point Focus Day", targeting your personal lagging muscle groups for dedicated breakthroughs (e.g. calves/forearms/abs/upper chest)',
  '第6章：高级分化与个体化': 'Chapter 6: Advanced Splits and Individualization',
  '第一次用自由重量务必先空杆/轻重量找感觉，卧推、深蹲要有保护杠或搭档在场': 'The first time you use free weights, be sure to start with an empty bar or light weight to get a feel for it; for bench press and squats, use safety bars or have a spotter present',
  '第一次训练完成，感觉怎么样？': 'First workout done — how did it feel?',
  '第一次走进健身房，不必急于上大重量。建议先在跑步机上快走 5 分钟热身，然后选择 2-3 台固定器械（如坐姿推胸、高位下拉、腿举），每台做 2 组、每组 12-15 次、用较轻的重量，感受目标肌群的发力。训练总时长控制在 30-40 分钟，避免过度疲劳影响后续坚持。训练后做 5 分钟静态拉伸，重点拉伸胸、背、腿。回家后记录今天的训练内容，这是建立训练习惯的第一步。': 'On your first visit to the gym, don\'t rush to lift heavy. Start with 5 minutes of brisk walking on the treadmill to warm up, then pick 2-3 machines (such as seated chest press, lat pulldown and leg press) and do 2 sets of 12-15 reps on each with a light weight, focusing on feeling the target muscles work. Keep the total session to 30-40 minutes so you don\'t get so exhausted that it hurts your consistency. Finish with 5 minutes of static stretching, focusing on chest, back and legs. Log what you did when you get home — this is the first step toward building a training habit.',
