  '结束前1公里逐步减速，慢走3-5分钟冷身，充分拉伸下肢和髋部，补充碳水蛋白质恢复。': 'In the final kilometer, gradually slow down, walk for 3-5 minutes to cool down, stretch the lower body and hips thoroughly, and replenish carbs and protein for recovery.',
  '结束前逐步减速至快走3-5分钟，最后进行下肢静态拉伸（股四头、腘绳、小腿），帮助恢复。': 'Near the end, gradually slow to a brisk walk for 3-5 minutes, then finish with static stretching for the lower body (quads, hamstrings, calves) to aid recovery.',
