  '缓慢下放膝盖至地面，休息放松，避免突然塌腰，逐步增加保持时间，完成一组训练。': 'Slowly lower your knees to the floor, rest and relax, avoid suddenly letting the lower back collapse, gradually increase the hold time, and complete the set.',
