  '缺乏训练日记记录，无法识别停滞模式与制定减重决策': 'No training log, so you can\'t identify stall patterns or make deload decisions',
  '缺口超过 1000 大卡会导致代谢适应、内分泌紊乱、暴食反弹。极低热量饮食不是减脂的捷径，而是反弹的起点': 'A deficit over 1,000 calories leads to metabolic adaptation, hormonal disruption and binge-eating rebound. A very-low-calorie diet isn\'t a shortcut to fat loss — it\'s the starting point of a rebound',
  '罗马凳（背部伸展）练竖脊肌与下背；健身球/药球可做核心训练；绳索卷腹、悬垂举腿练腹发力感。核心不是"只练腹肌"，稳定腰椎才是关键，建议在每次训练最后留 5-10 分钟做核心。': 'The Roman chair (back extension) trains the erector spinae and lower back; a stability ball or medicine ball can be used for core work; cable crunches and hanging leg raises build ab engagement. Core training isn\'t "just abs" — stabilizing the lumbar spine is the key, so leave 5-10 minutes for core work at the end of every session.',
  '罗马尼亚硬拉': 'Romanian Deadlift',
  '罗马尼亚硬拉：屈髋将铃沿腿下滑至小腿中段 — 主练后链': 'Romanian Deadlift: hinge at the hips and slide the bar down your legs to mid-shin — primarily trains the posterior chain',
