  '肩部日与手臂日相邻，三头在肩推中已疲劳影响手臂日表现，应间隔至少48小时': 'Scheduling shoulder day next to arm day means the triceps are already fatigued from shoulder press, hurting arm day performance — leave at least 48 hours between them',
  '肩部日安排在胸部日后第二天，推力肌群（前束/三头）过度疲劳影响肩推表现': 'Scheduling shoulder day the day after chest day over-fatigues the pressing muscles (front delts/triceps) and hurts shoulder press performance',
  '肩部日应包含面拉3×15-20维护肩关节健康，激活斜方肌中下束与菱形肌': 'Shoulder day should include face pulls 3×15-20 to maintain shoulder health and activate the middle and lower traps and rhomboids',
  '肩：坐姿肩推机（前中束）；手臂：绳索下压（三头）、弯举机（二头）；胸：坐姿推胸机、蝴蝶机；背：高位下拉、坐姿划船。记住口诀——"推的练胸肩、拉的练背、悬垂下拉练背阔"，照着这台机器要动的关节就能反推出它练哪里。': 'Shoulders: seated shoulder press machine (front and medial delts); Arms: cable pushdown (triceps), curl machine (biceps); Chest: seated chest press machine, pec deck; Back: lat pulldown, seated row. Remember the rule of thumb — "pressing works chest and shoulders, pulling works the back, hanging pulldowns work the lats." Just look at which joint the machine moves and you can figure out what it trains.',
  '肱三头肌': 'Triceps',
  '肱三头肌占上臂体积2/3，臂围突破应优先三头：先过头位（仰卧臂屈伸/绳索过头上拉）激活长头': 'The triceps make up 2/3 of upper arm mass, so prioritize them to break through arm size plateaus: start with overhead positions (lying triceps extension / overhead cable extension) to activate the long head',
  '肱二头肌': 'Biceps',
  '肱二头肌发力，将哑铃沿弧线弯举至肩部，呼气，肘关节保持固定不前后移动，腕关节中立。': 'Drive with the biceps to curl the dumbbells in an arc up to shoulder level, exhale, keep the elbow joint fixed without drifting forward or back, and keep the wrist neutral.',
  '肱二头肌和肱桡肌发力，保持掌心相对，将哑铃沿弧线弯举至肩部，呼气，肘部固定不晃动。': 'Drive with the biceps and brachioradialis, keep the palms facing each other, curl the dumbbells in an arc up to shoulder level, exhale, with the elbows fixed and no swinging.',
  '肱二头肌长头：上斜哑铃弯举（肩伸位拉伸长头）+ 集中弯举（短头峰收缩）；牧师凳弯举强调短头': 'Biceps long head: incline dumbbell curl (shoulder extension stretches the long head) + concentration curl (short head peak contraction); the preacher curl emphasizes the short head',
