  '背部日只做垂直拉（下拉/引体）忽视水平拉（划船），导致背部宽度有余而厚度不足，建议垂直拉:水平拉=4:6': 'On back day, doing only vertical pulls (pulldowns/pull-ups) while neglecting horizontal pulls (rows) leaves you wide but not thick; aim for a vertical-to-horizontal pull ratio of 4:6',
