  '背阔肌发力，肘部引导向下后方压，将把手拉至锁骨/上胸位置，呼气，肩胛下回旋后缩。': 'Drive with the lats, guide the elbows down and back to pull the handle to the collarbone/upper chest, exhale, with the scapula downwardly rotating and retracting.',
  '背阔肌发力，肘部贴身向后上方拉起杠铃至下腹/肚脐位置，肩胛后缩，呼气，肘部不外展。': 'Drive with the lats, pull the bar up and back with the elbows tucked to the lower abs/navel, retract the scapula, exhale, with the elbows not flared.',
  '背阔肌发力，肘部贴身向后拉把手至腹部，肩胛后缩，呼气，肘部不外展，躯干不后仰借力。': 'Drive with the lats, pull the handle back to the abdomen with the elbows tucked, retract the scapula, exhale, with the elbows not flared and no torso lean-back to cheat.',
  '背阔肌宽度vs厚度分化：宽握正手引体/下拉强调背阔上外侧与大圆肌（宽度），对握/反手强调下内侧（厚度）': 'Lat width vs. thickness: wide pronated-grip pull-ups/pulldowns emphasize the upper-outer lats and teres major (width); neutral or supinated grip emphasizes the lower-inner lats (thickness)',
