  '胸/背/腿/肩/臂五分化，每肌群每周专注训练1次，单肌群周容量16-20组处于Schoenfeld肌肥大上限区间': 'A five-way split (chest/back/legs/shoulders/arms), hitting each muscle group once per week with 16-20 sets per muscle per week — the upper end of Schoenfeld\'s hypertrophy range',
  '胸/背/腿/肩四分化，每肌群每周训练1次，单肌群周容量12-16组覆盖Pelland 2024 meta分析的递减回报区间': 'A four-way split (chest/back/legs/shoulders), training each muscle group once per week with 12-16 sets per muscle per week, covering the diminishing-returns range in Pelland\'s 2024 meta-analysis',
  '胸前交汇顶峰收缩2秒': 'Hold the peak contraction for 2 seconds where the hands meet in front of the chest',
