  '胸大肌': 'Pectoralis Major',
  '胸大肌上部': 'Upper Pectoralis Major',
  '胸大肌主动发力，沿原轨迹垂直上推，肘部同步伸直，推起过程呼气，避免肩胛前引，保持挺胸。': 'Drive with the pecs to press straight up along the original path, extending the elbows at the same time, exhale during the press, avoid scapular protraction and keep the chest up.',
  '胸大肌发力将把手向胸前下方弧线夹拢，肘部引导，呼气，在胸前交汇处顶峰收缩2秒，感受胸肌挤压。': 'Drive with the pecs to sweep the handles in an arc down and together in front of the chest, elbows leading, exhale, and hold the peak contraction for 2 seconds where the hands meet, feeling the chest squeeze.',
  '胸大肌发力沿弧线将哑铃合拢至起始位置，呼气，顶峰收缩1-2秒，想象抱住一棵大树，肩胛保持稳定。': 'Drive with the pecs to bring the dumbbells together along an arc back to the start, exhale, hold the peak contraction for 1-2 seconds, imagine hugging a big tree, and keep the scapula stable.',
