  '脊柱中立位：维持腰椎自然前凸+胸椎微后凸，瓦式呼吸+腹内压加压稳定脊柱，屈曲使剪切力转移至椎间盘': 'Neutral spine: maintain the natural lordosis of the lumbar spine plus slight thoracic kyphosis; the Valsalva maneuver and intra-abdominal pressure stabilize the spine, while flexion shifts shear force onto the discs',
