  '腘绳肌在深蹲中EMG激活有限（双关节肌，髋膝同步伸展使其长度变化小），必须用RDL独立训练': 'Hamstring EMG activation in the squat is limited (it\'s a biarticular muscle, and simultaneous hip and knee extension means little length change), so the RDL is needed to train it directly',
  '腘绳肌髋主导vs膝主导分离：RDL 4×6-8（半腱肌/半膜肌+臀大肌）+ 腿弯举3×10-15（股二头肌短头）': 'Hamstrings, hip-dominant vs knee-dominant separation: RDL 4×6-8 (semitendinosus/semimembranosus + glute max) + leg curl 3×10-15 (biceps femoris short head)',
