  '腹斜肌：俄罗斯转体/侧平板/单车卷腹，每组20-30次，避免过大重量防止腹斜肌过度肥大粗腰': 'Obliques: Russian twists / side plank / bicycle crunches, 20-30 reps per set; avoid heavy loading to prevent excessive oblique hypertrophy and a blocky waist',
  '腹横肌': 'Transverse Abdominis',
  '腹横肌（深层核心）：平板支撑/死虫式/鸟狗式，每组30-60秒，提升核心稳定性维持腹内压': 'Transverse abdominis (deep core): plank / dead bug / bird dog, 30-60 seconds per set, improving core stability and maintaining intra-abdominal pressure',
  '腹直肌': 'Rectus Abdominis',
  '腹直肌发力卷起': 'Rectus abdominis drives the curl-up',
  '腹直肌发力将肩胛骨抬离地面，呼气，脊柱逐节卷起，下背保持贴地，不拽头颈借力。': 'Drive with the rectus abdominis to lift the shoulder blades off the floor, exhale, curl the spine up vertebra by vertebra, keep the lower back on the floor, and don\'t pull on your head or neck for momentum.',
  '腹肌显现三要素：体脂率（男<15%/女<22%）+ 腹肌厚度训练 + 饮食控制（不可局部减脂）': 'Three keys to visible abs: body fat percentage (men <15% / women <22%) + ab thickness training + diet control (spot reduction is impossible)',
