  '腿': 'Legs',
  '腿/手臂': 'Legs/Arms',
  '腿举': 'Leg Press',
  '腿举替代深蹲：保护腰椎，刺激股四头充分\n高位下拉替代引体：可调节负荷，避免肩关节冲击\n坐姿推胸替代卧推：肩胛有支撑，减少肩前侧压力\n绳索划船替代杠铃划船：腰部有支撑，背阔肌孤立充分\n哑铃推举替代杠铃推举：手腕自然，避免肩峰下撞击': 'Leg press instead of squats: protects the lumbar spine and fully stimulates the quads\nLat pulldown instead of pull-ups: adjustable load, less shoulder impact\nSeated chest press instead of bench press: scapular support, less pressure on the front shoulder\nCable row instead of barbell row: lumbar support, better lat isolation\nDumbbell press instead of barbell press: natural wrist position, avoids subacromial impingement',
  '腿举机可以安全地使用大重量训练腿部，主要锻炼股四头肌和臀大肌。': 'The leg press machine lets you train your legs safely with heavy loads, primarily working the quads and glutes.',
  '腿举机：主练股四头肌、臀大肌，轨迹安全适合加重量\n腿弯举：主练腘绳肌（腿后侧），补足深蹲容易忽略的部位\n腿屈伸：孤立股四头肌，适合力竭后的补充\n史密斯架：兼顾深蹲/臀推，轨迹被固定更稳': 'Leg press: primarily quads and glutes, safe path for adding weight\nLeg curl: primarily the hamstrings (back of the thigh), covering what squats tend to miss\nLeg extension: isolates the quads, a good add-on after failure\nSmith machine: works for both squats and hip thrusts, with a fixed and more stable path',
  '腿屈伸': 'Leg Extension',
  '腿弯举': 'Leg Curl',
  '腿日训练后24小时内进行高冲击有氧（跑步）影响恢复，应改用骑行或坡度走': 'Doing high-impact cardio (running) within 24 hours after leg day impairs recovery; switch to cycling or incline walking',
  '腿部': 'Legs',
  '腿部 + 手臂': 'Legs + Arms',
  '腿部与臀部是全身力量与塑形的关键。本章用 4 个哑铃动作覆盖臀腿主肌群，均有图解与要点。': 'Legs and glutes are the key to full-body strength and physique. This chapter covers the main hip and leg muscle groups with 4 dumbbell exercises, each with illustrations and key points.',
  '腿部专项周期：每周2次，股四头肌日与腘绳肌日分离，单肌群周容量12-16组': 'Leg specialization cycle: 2x per week, separating quad day and hamstring day, 12-16 sets per muscle per week',
  '腿部专项突破指南': 'Guide to Specializing on Your Legs',
  '腿部日只做深蹲忽视硬拉，导致前后链肌力不平衡': 'Doing only squats on leg day while neglecting deadlifts leads to anterior/posterior chain strength imbalance',
  '腿部日可拆分为股四头肌主导（后蹲5×5+前蹲3×8+腿屈伸3×12）与腘绳肌主导（RDL 4×6+腿弯举3×12+提踵4×15）': 'Leg day can be split into a quad-dominant session (back squat 5×5 + front squat 3×8 + leg extension 3×12) and a hamstring-dominant session (RDL 4×6 + leg curl 3×12 + calf raise 4×15)',
