  '自由': 'Free Spirit',
  '自由心得': 'Free Notes',
  '自由重量 vs 固定器械': 'Free Weights vs Machines',
  '自由重量器械（杠铃、哑铃、深蹲架、卧推架）靠你的身体主导运动轨迹，能调动更多稳定肌，是增肌、增力的首选；但需要一定控制能力。固定器械轨迹固定、更安全，适合新手找发力感和康复期。下面我们先认识健身房最常见的自由重量区。': 'Free weight equipment (barbells, dumbbells, squat racks, bench press racks) lets your body dictate the movement path and recruits more stabilizer muscles, making it the top choice for building muscle and strength — but it requires a certain amount of control. Machines have a fixed path and are safer, making them ideal for beginners learning to feel a muscle work and for rehab phases. Next, let\'s get to know the most common free weights area in the gym.',
  '自由重量必须有保护杠或搭档，杠铃片锁紧\n用固定器械先调好座位与轨道，动作全程不锁死关节\n重量选择宁可轻，最后 2-3 次应感到吃力但能保持标准\n每组间留足休息（通常 60-90 秒），不追求一次性力竭\n出现刺痛立即停止，训练前充分热身': 'Free weights require safety bars or a spotter, and the plates must be secured\nWith machines, adjust the seat and range of motion first, and never lock out a joint during the movement\nChoose a weight on the lighter side — the last 2-3 reps should feel hard but still technically clean\nTake enough rest between sets (usually 60-90 seconds); don\'t chase failure on every set\nStop immediately if you feel a sharp pain, and warm up thoroughly before training',
  '自重': 'Bodyweight',
  '自重 HIIT 适合初学者和居家训练，负重 HIIT 适合进阶者。负重选择：壶铃（摆荡、深蹲推举）、哑铃（抓举、推举）、战绳（双鞭、交替鞭）、沙袋（搬运、深蹲）。负重 HIIT 强度更高、对力量保留更好，但需要更长的动作学习期。建议先掌握自重 HIIT 4-8 周，再过渡到负重。负重选择 10-15RM 的重量，HIIT 期间不加重，重点是心率和容量。负重 HIIT 每周不超过 2 次，避免神经系统过度疲劳。': 'Bodyweight HIIT suits beginners and home training, while loaded HIIT suits more advanced trainees. Loading options: kettlebells (swings, squat presses), dumbbells (snatches, presses), battle ropes (double waves, alternating waves) and sandbags (carries, squats). Loaded HIIT is higher intensity and better for preserving strength, but has a longer learning curve. Master bodyweight HIIT for 4-8 weeks before moving to loading. Pick a 10-15RM load and don\'t add weight during the session — focus on heart rate and volume. Keep loaded HIIT to no more than 2 sessions per week to avoid excessive nervous system fatigue.',
  '自重/器械': 'Bodyweight/Machine',
  '自重深蹲': 'Bodyweight Squat',
  '舒缓': 'Relaxed',
  '节奏切换的周期化': 'Periodization with Tempo Switches',
  '节奏四位数标识法': 'Four-Digit Tempo Notation',
  '节奏格式：离心-底部停顿-向心-顶峰停顿（如 3-1-1-1）。\n\n塑形期推荐：2-1-2-1 标准 / 4-1-1-1 强调离心。\n\nTUT 目标：复合 30-40 秒/组，孤立 40-60 秒/组。': 'Tempo format: eccentric - bottom pause - concentric - peak pause (e.g. 3-1-1-1).\n\nRecommended for shaping phases: 2-1-2-1 standard / 4-1-1-1 emphasizing the eccentric.\n\nTUT target: 30-40 seconds per set for compound lifts, 40-60 seconds for isolation.',
