  '营养与睡眠跟不上训练频率，反而导致肌肉分解与免疫力下降': 'Nutrition and sleep not keeping up with training frequency backfires, causing muscle breakdown and weaker immunity',
  '营养建议': 'Nutrition Tips',
  '营养时机的实战建议': 'Practical Nutrition Timing Tips',
  '营养素分配与时机': 'Nutrient Distribution and Timing',
  '营养：蛋白质 1.2-1.6g/kg、均衡碳水脂肪、避免极端饮食。\n\n睡眠：7-9 小时，深睡占比 20-25%。\n\n压力管理：冥想/呼吸/社交，皮质醇管理关乎训练恢复。\n\n长期坚持：习惯化、社交化、目标化。': 'Nutrition: protein 1.2-1.6g/kg, balanced carbs and fats, avoid extreme diets.\n\nSleep: 7-9 hours, with deep sleep making up 20-25%.\n\nStress management: meditation/breathing/social connection — managing cortisol matters for training recovery.\n\nLong-term consistency: build habits, make it social, set goals.',
  '虚拟对手PK': 'Virtual Opponent Battle',
  '虚拟物品': 'Virtual Items',
  '蛋白质 1.2-1.6g/kg，分散 4 餐摄入，每餐 25-35g\n碳水占总热量 45-55%，训练前后为主\n脂肪占 25-30%，优选不饱和脂肪\n蔬果每日 500g，提供纤维与微量元素\n水分 2-3 升，训练时少量多次补充': 'Protein 1.2-1.6g/kg, spread across 4 meals, 25-35g per meal\nCarbs 45-55% of total calories, mostly around training\nFat 25-30%, preferably unsaturated\n500g of fruits and vegetables daily for fiber and micronutrients\n2-3 liters of water, sipped in small amounts throughout training',
  '蛋白质——减脂期的守护神': 'Protein — Your Guardian During a Cut',
  '蛋白质提升至2.2-2.6 g/kg/天（Nunes 2022 meta：≥1.6 g/kg组FFM增量效应量g=0.30 vs 1.2-1.59组g=0.17）': 'Increase protein to 2.2-2.6 g/kg/day (Nunes 2022 meta: the ≥1.6 g/kg group showed an FFM gain effect size of g=0.30 vs g=0.17 for the 1.2-1.59 group)',
  '蛋白质摄入策略': 'Protein Intake Strategy',
  '蛋白质：每公斤体重1.8-2.4克，减脂期保肌肉的关键。\n\n脂肪：占总热量25-30%，不低于每公斤0.8克，维持激素水平。\n\n碳水：剩余热量分配，训练日多碳水、休息日少碳水。\n\n纤维：每日25-30克，蔬菜为主，增加饱腹感。\n\n水分：每日2-3升，饭前喝水可增加饱腹感。': 'Protein: 1.8-2.4g per kg of body weight — the key to preserving muscle during a cut.\n\nFat: 25-30% of total calories, no less than 0.8g per kg, to maintain hormone levels.\n\nCarbs: fill the remaining calories, more on training days and less on rest days.\n\nFiber: 25-30g daily, mainly from vegetables, to increase satiety.\n\nWater: 2-3 liters daily; drinking before meals increases satiety.',
  '蝴蝶机（夹胸机）靠夹臂动作练胸大肌中缝，轨迹安全、上手快；坐姿推胸机则模拟卧推练整块胸。新手建议先坐姿推胸建立胸腔发力感，再用蝴蝶机收缝。': 'The pec deck (chest fly machine) uses a hugging arm motion to work the midline of the pecs, with a safe path and an easy learning curve; the seated chest press machine mimics the bench press to train the whole chest. Beginners should start with the seated chest press to build chest engagement, then use the pec deck to carve the inner line.',
