  '计划数据较大（\${shareString.length}字符），无法生成二维码。\n请使用「复制分享串」或「分享」按钮发送。': 'The plan data is too large (\${shareString.length} characters) to generate a QR code.\nPlease use the "Copy Share String" or "Share" button to send it.',
