  '计划：\${r[\'planName\']}': 'Plan: \${r[\'planName\']}',
  '计算 TDEE': 'Calculate TDEE',
  '认识健身房区域划分与基础礼仪。\n\n器械区：固定器械适合新手找到发力感，自由重量区（杠铃/哑铃）适合进阶训练。\n\n有氧区：跑步机、椭圆机、划船机，用于热身和减脂。\n\n力量区：深蹲架、卧推架、硬拉台，是增肌训练的核心区域。\n\n礼仪提示：用完器械归位、自带毛巾、不长时间占用热门器械。': 'Get to know the gym floor layout and basic etiquette.\n\nMachine area: fixed machines help beginners feel the target muscle work; the free weights area (barbells/dumbbells) suits more advanced training.\n\nCardio area: treadmills, ellipticals, and rowing machines for warm-ups and fat loss.\n\nStrength area: squat racks, bench press racks, and deadlift platforms — the core zone for muscle building.\n\nEtiquette: re-rack your weights, bring your own towel, and don\'t hog popular equipment.',
  '让训练变难的三种方式': 'Three Ways to Make Training Harder',
  '训练': 'Workout',
  '训练 A：深蹲 3×5 / 卧推 3×5 / 划船 3×5\n训练 B：深蹲 3×5 / 推举 3×5 / 硬拉 1×5\n频率：每周 3 次，A-B-A 第一周，B-A-B 第二周\n组间：3-5 分钟（复合动作）\n辅助：引体/双杠/核心 2-3 组可选': 'Workout A: Squat 3×5 / Bench Press 3×5 / Row 3×5\nWorkout B: Squat 3×5 / Overhead Press 3×5 / Deadlift 1×5\nFrequency: 3 times per week, A-B-A in week 1, B-A-B in week 2\nRest between sets: 3-5 minutes (compound lifts)\nAssistance: pull-ups / dips / core, 2-3 sets optional',
  '训练休息提醒': 'Workout Rest Reminder',
  '训练准备': 'Workout Prep',
  '训练前检查杠铃片是否锁紧，锁扣是否到位\n深蹲时将保护杠调至略低于最低下蹲位置的高度\n卧推大重量时必须有人保护，保护者熟悉起杠与助力技巧\n不在力竭时勉强尝试大重量，宁可降重量保动作质量\n使用深蹲架、卧推架前确认销孔销紧，避免器械移位': 'Before training, check that the plates are secured and the collars are in place\nWhen squatting, set the safety bars slightly below your lowest squat position\nFor heavy bench press, always have a spotter who knows how to lift off and assist\nNever grind out heavy weight at failure — lower the weight and protect your form\nBefore using a squat rack or bench, make sure the pins are fully seated so the equipment can\'t shift',
  '训练动作': 'Exercises',
  '训练反馈与提示音效': 'Workout Feedback & Cue Sounds',
  '训练只是给肌肉一个生长的信号，真正的修复和生长发生在睡眠中。生长激素的分泌在深睡眠期达到峰值，肌肉蛋白合成速率也显著提升。每晚 7-9 小时是增肌者的底线，少于 6 小时直接削弱训练收益。睡眠不足会降低睾酮、提升皮质醇、影响食欲调控激素（瘦素下降、饥饿素上升），让你更容易暴食、训练无力、肌肉流失。': 'Training only gives your muscles a signal to grow; the real repair and growth happen while you sleep. Growth hormone secretion peaks during deep sleep, and muscle protein synthesis rises significantly too. 7-9 hours a night is the baseline for anyone building muscle — anything under 6 hours directly undercuts your training results. Lack of sleep lowers testosterone, raises cortisol, and disrupts the hormones that regulate appetite (leptin drops, ghrelin rises), making you more likely to binge eat, train weak, and lose muscle.',
  '训练后 30 分钟内摄入 20-30 克快速吸收的蛋白质（如乳清蛋白粉）+ 一份碳水（如香蕉），能加速肌肉修复与糖原补充': 'Taking in 20-30 g of fast-absorbing protein (such as whey protein powder) plus a serving of carbs (such as a banana) within 30 minutes after training speeds up muscle repair and glycogen replenishment',
  '训练后30分钟内补充蛋白质，能最大化肌肉修复与生长效果。': 'Taking in protein within 30 minutes after training maximizes muscle repair and growth.',
