  '记录训练日志是进步的关键——没有记录就没有渐进超负荷。记下每次的重量、组数、次数与感受，下次训练才能有方向地突破': 'Logging your workouts is the key to progress — no records means no progressive overload. Write down the weight, sets, reps, and how it felt each time so your next session has a clear direction to push',
