  '起身时臀部先抬起': 'Hips rise first when standing up',
  '超级组与代谢压力': 'Supersets and Metabolic Stress',
  '超级组搭配：杠铃弯举+绳索下压、哑铃锤式+仰卧臂屈伸，组间60-75秒维持代谢压力': 'Superset pairings: barbell curl + rope pushdown, dumbbell hammer curl + lying triceps extension, with 60-75 seconds between sets to maintain metabolic stress',
  '超级组：两个动作背靠背无休息，如弯举+三头下压\n三联组：三个动作连续，如侧平举+前平举+面拉\ndrop set：力竭后立即降重量 30% 继续，连续 2-3 次\n21响：7下半程+7上半程+7全程，TUT 极长\n部分幅度：力竭后做部分幅度重复，榨干最后能量': 'Superset: two exercises back to back with no rest, e.g. curl + triceps pushdown\nTriset: three exercises in a row, e.g. lateral raise + front raise + face pull\nDrop set: right after failure, drop the weight 30% and keep going, 2-3 times in a row\n21s: 7 bottom-half + 7 top-half + 7 full reps, extremely long TUT\nPartial reps: after failure, keep repping through a partial range to drain the last of your energy',
  '超越': 'Surpass',
  '超越同水平 \$percentile% 用户': 'Ahead of \$percentile% of users at your level',
  '超重': 'Overweight',
  '足中发力站起': 'Drive through midfoot to stand',
  '足中发力，臀部和股四头肌同步发力站起，呼气，膝盖不内扣，保持外展与脚尖方向一致。': 'Drive through the midfoot, firing the glutes and quads together to stand, exhale, keep the knees from caving in, and keep them tracking out in line with your toes.',
  '足跟发力蹬起': 'Drive through the heels',
  '足跟发力蹬起踏板，股四头肌和臀大肌同步发力，呼气，保持膝盖与脚尖方向一致不内扣。': 'Press through your heels into the platform, driving the quads and glutes together, exhale, and keep your knees in line with your toes without caving in.',
  '跌倒是中老年最常见的意外伤害。本章介绍简单有效的平衡训练方法，强化核心与下肢稳定性，大幅降低跌倒风险。': 'Falls are the most common accidental injury among older adults. This chapter covers simple, effective balance training that strengthens the core and lower-body stability, greatly reducing the risk of falling.',
