  '跟随系统': 'Follow System',
  '跪姿俯卧撑、平板支撑、卷腹、超人式覆盖了上肢和核心的主要需求。跪姿俯卧撑练胸臂，平板支撑练核心稳定，卷腹练腹部发力感，超人式练下背。把这 4 个动作编成一组循环，就是一套完整的居家循环训练。': 'Knee push-ups, planks, crunches, and the Superman cover the main needs of the upper body and core. Knee push-ups train the chest and arms, planks build core stability, crunches teach you to engage the abs, and the Superman strengthens the lower back. String these 4 exercises into a circuit and you have a complete home circuit workout.',
