  '锤式弯举同时锻炼肱二头肌和肱桡肌，增加手臂整体围度。': 'The hammer curl trains both the biceps and the brachioradialis, adding overall arm size.',
  '长期健康维持': 'Long-Term Health Maintenance',
  '长期单一动作会强化某些肌群而忽视另一些，造成肌力不平衡和慢性伤病。健康训练应每 4-6 周轮换 1-2 个动作，例如腿举→前蹲→保加利亚分腿蹲。同时针对弱链补强：肩袖（面拉/外旋）、臀中肌（蚌式/侧抬腿）、核心（鸟狗式/死虫式）。这些小肌群训练不增加围度，但显著提升关节稳定性，是 30+ 训练者的"保险投资"。': 'Doing the same exercises for too long strengthens some muscle groups while neglecting others, causing strength imbalances and chronic injuries. Healthy training should rotate 1-2 exercises every 4-6 weeks, for example leg press → front squat → Bulgarian split squat. At the same time, reinforce your weak links: rotator cuff (face pulls / external rotation), glute medius (clamshells / side leg raises), core (bird-dog / dead bug). These small-muscle exercises don\'t add size, but they significantly improve joint stability — an "insurance investment" for lifters over 30.',
