  '靠墙深蹲：背靠墙下蹲，保护膝盖又安全\n座椅起立：练腿力与平衡的基础动作\n弹力带划船：练背，改善含胸驼背\n靠墙俯卧撑：练胸臂，减轻手腕负担\n提踵：强化小腿与踝关节稳定性': 'Wall sit: squat with your back against the wall — safe and easy on the knees\nSeated stand-up: a foundational move for leg strength and balance\nBand row: trains the back and improves rounded shoulders\nWall push-up: trains the chest and arms with less wrist stress\nHeel raises: strengthen the calves and ankle stability',
  '靠手臂下拉而非背阔': 'Pulling with the arms instead of the lats',
