  '面向 1.5 年以上训练经验的中高级增肌者，6 章覆盖周期化、容量微周期、辅助动作专项、代谢压力技术、deload 与高级分化。突破自然训练者的肌肥大上限。': 'For intermediate to advanced muscle-building trainees with 1.5+ years of experience, 6 chapters cover periodization, volume microcycles, dedicated assistance work, metabolic stress techniques, deloads, and advanced splits. Break past the natural trainee\'s hypertrophy ceiling.',
  '面向 30+ 岁追求长期健康的训练者，4 章建立可持续的训练-营养-恢复体系。强调关节健康、心肺功能、力量保留与生活方式平衡，让训练服务终身健康。': 'For trainees over 30 focused on long-term health, 4 chapters build a sustainable training-nutrition-recovery system. Emphasis on joint health, cardiorespiratory fitness, strength preservation, and lifestyle balance, so training serves a lifetime of health.',
  '面拉': 'Face Pull',
  '面拉3-4组×15-20次作为收尾：综合激活斜方中下束、菱形肌、三角肌后束与肩袖，维护肩关节健康': 'Finish with 3-4 sets × 15-20 reps of face pulls: they activate the middle and lower traps, rhomboids, rear delts, and rotator cuff together, keeping your shoulder joints healthy',
